<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">- Ndendeule Bible Verses</book>
  <para style="h">Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabo Cha Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoch</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabo Cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabo cha Yoshuwa kijhendelela kuchimulila mambo gha kilambo cha Akaichilahele kone kitumbuu chehemo jhela kitabo cha Kombokela lya mihilo pikijhomolela. Kipinde kitabo cha Yoshuwa pukitumbula kwa chimulila bhando bhaku Akaichilaele bhibhakibha bhabhekite kighono upandi ghulitipiki lyobha mwa lukemba Yoludane. Kitabo chenje cha Yoshuwa kichimulila namuna Akaichilahele chijhabhajhombwika lukemba Yoludane na kukitola kilambo cha Kanaane, kongo bhabhii pahe jha ulongoche gwa Yoshuwa, jmmujhila jwa Mucha. Bhatehila yene nhwalo Chapanga akabhalaghalikii kutenda yene. Mu malobhe ghanga, Chapanga akibha alenganikiya lilaghano jhalaghila kubhehe nabhapela ibheluko yake Ulahimo kilambo chenje jhikibha itamilwa na Akakanaane, kitabo Chukutumbula 12:7.</para>
  <para style="ip">Imanyikana jhe ghane jwajhandike kitabo cha Yoshuwa. Kipinde chenie, jwajhandika kwa nnandanikilo Yoshuwaantenda mundo kuwacha kubhehe pange jwene pange akibha alombina ilebhe yoha ipitila 5:1-6. Ku nhwalo ghongo nhwalo, akachomi twe bha Bibuliya piwacha kubhehe Yochowa jwenio ndi jwajhandike chehemo ngolongwa jha kitabo chenje. Helahela chakaka kubhehe pange mundo jhonge panja na Yoshuwa akajhandike chehemo mu kitabo chenje, ngita hela, ilebhe kuwegha na kuchikwa kwa Yoshuwa, Yoshuwa 24:29. Akachomi bhange bhiwacha kubhehe kitabo chenje pange kikajhandikwe mu chaka cha 800 bhipitila lijhambu. Mambu ghighalongela mu kitabo cha Yoshuwa iwechekena ghakapitii mu chaka cha 1250, kabula jhukubhelukwa Kilichitu. Ngita hela yaka 40 bada jha Falao Lamasesi kutumbuu kulongocha kilambo chuku Michile. Lamasesi jwenio ndi kilongoche jwaholelelwa kubhehe akalongwiche kilambo chaku Michile mu kipinde cha bhando bhuku Ichilahele pibhabhokita mu kilambo chuku Michile, Kubhoka 1:11.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mu kitabo</para>
  <para style="io">Mu chula jha 1 ade chula jha 5:12, ichimulila Akaichilaele pibhajhombwika lukemba Yoludane nu kuhika kukilambo cha ku Kanaane.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhe, mu chula jha 5:13 ade jha 12, ichimulila mipangu jhe Akaichilaele kwajhingilila na kwahotola bhando bhikilambo chuku Kanaane.</para>
  <para style="io">Pighajhomokila gheniya, mu chula jha 13-21, ichimulila namuna kilambo chuku Kanaane chibhaghinwa kwa makabila ghoha kome na mabhele gha Akaichilahele.</para>
  <para style="io">Kujhomolela, mu chula jha 22-24, ichimulila namuna makabila ghange chighabhujhila upandi ghulihumii lyobha mwa lukemba Yoludane, malobhe ghakujhomolela gha Yoshuwa kwa kilambo chuku Ichilahele, kuwe na kuchikwa kwa pamonga na namuna jha Akaichilahele chibhatehila kwa kubhujhila lilaghano lyabhe na Chapanga.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga annaghaliki Yoshuwa kukipukila kilambo chuku Kanaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />Pajhomwika Mucha ntumiche gwa Bhambo Chapanga, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nune, ntangatila jwa Mucha, <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />ngalongila, “Ntumiche gwango Mucha ajhomwike, ngohe mwenga pamonga na Akaichilahele bhoha nnyomboke lukemba lwa ku Yoludane, ade ku kilambo chela chambakwape Akaichilahele. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" />Kila pimipakulebhata lwajho lwino napabhaa pino ngita chininnaghila Mucha. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" />Mipaka jha kilambo chino naitumbulila kunjenga upandi gwa kuchine ade kachikachine mwa itombe ya ku Lebanone. Kwa upandi kulihumii lyobha ndi lukemba lola lukolongwa lwa ku Efulate, na kilambo choha cha Akahite, ade ku mbwane jha Meditelaniya kwa upandi ghulitipikii lyobha. <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" />Napitii ng'o mundo jwakunhotola mu ughome gwino ghoha. Namma pamonga na mwenga ngita chamila na Mucha, machiko ghoha naninneka jhe hilu pandina. <verse eid="JOS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" />Mangalendema jhe na mma nganganga, nhwalo mwenga ndi namalongocha bhando bhamba kutola kilambo chinalaghii kwapela akahoko bhabhe. <verse eid="JOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" />Nambo mma nganganga na mangalendema jhe na mukilolokehe kwa kulikamu lilaghalikilo lyoha lyannaghila Mucha ntumiche gwango. Kila lilaghalikilo mulikamule na mwenga namma na mota popoha pumijhenda. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" />Dolokeya nkoto kukileka kitabo chenje cha lilaghalikilo, nambo kila lichiko namukibhola kilo na muhe kitabo chenje, kupala kuhenga ghoha ghighajhandikwe mwenio, na mwenga nankonda hake popoha pumijhenda. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" />Nkomboka nenga ndi jwanongila mangalendema jhe! Mma nganganga mangajhoghopa hilu kuhechuka, nhwalo nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino mi pamonga na mwenga popoha pumijhenda.”<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa alenganikii bhando kujhomboka lukemba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Bhahe, Yoshuwa ngabhalaghila ilongoche ya akakomana ngondo, <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" />Nnyende mu ighono ya bhando na malobholela, “Bhalenganikiya machulupo, kunhwalo pighapeta machiko matato nannyomboka lukemba lwa ku Yoludane, nu kujhenda kutola kilambo chela Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ampekii kubhehe kilambo chino.”<verse eid="JOS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />Yoshuwa ngalongila kwa bhando bha likabila lya Leubene na likabila lya Gade na nucho jha likabila lya Manache kubhehe, <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" />“Nkomboka malobhe ghala ghalongila Mucha ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nampela chehemo pa kupomolela, natutola kilambo chenje upande ghulihumii lyobha mwa lukemba lwa Yoludane. <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />Akaana bhino na yana hino na inyama hino yukolekwa nabhahighilika mu kilambo chenje champela Mucha upande ghulihumi lyobha mwa Yoludane, nambo akakomana ngondo kongo bhabhii na chilaha yabhe nabhatangatila akalongo bhino kujhomboka, <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />namatangatila ade Bhambo Chapanga papakwapela akalongo bhino chehemo jha kupomolela helahela, ngita champi mangota, na bhene hele nabhatola kilambo chibhapala kupelwa na Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. Peniya nankelebhuka mu kilambo chimpilwa na Mucha ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga, upande gwa kulihumii lyobha mwa Yoludane.”<verse eid="JOS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />Bhene ngabhannyangwila Yoshuwa kubhehe, “Chimilonge chochoha natuhenga, natujhenda popoha pimitutuma. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" />Ngita hele chitunnyokanikiya Mucha, ndi chitupa kunnyokanikiya mwenga. Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino abhaha pamo na mwenga ngita chabhila na Mucha. <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />Mundo jhojhoha jwangajhokanikiya malobhe ghino, nakomwa. Mwenga mme nganganga na mangalendema jhe!”<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa abhatuma bhibhalingukiya ku Yeliko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />Bhahe, Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nune, ngatuma kwakiyepela bhando bhabhele kubhoka ku Shitimo bhajhende bhakalingukiye ku Yeliko, pubhahikita ku Yeliko, ngabhahikila pa nyumba jha mwikeghe jhumo nngongola liina lyake Lahabo, ngabhagholwika pena. <verse eid="JOS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" />Munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Yeliko ngalobholilwa, “Dola, Uhiko ghongo Akaichilahele bhajhingii kulingukiya kilambo chito.” <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Bhahe, munahota jwa ku Yeliko ngatuma bhando kwa Lahabo, alongila, “Bhapiya panja bhando bhubhabhi mu nyumba jhino nhwalo bheniya bhahikite kulingukiya kilambo choha.”<verse eid="JOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4" />Nambo mwikeghe jhola akibha abhahihite bhando bheniya, ngalonge, “Chakaka bhakahikite kwa nenga, nambo namanyii jhe kubhahumii. <verse eid="JOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5" />Kabula jha kudinda nnyango gwa muche pulujhingila lubhendo, bhando bheniya ngabhabhokita. Na kubhajhenda ne nikumanyii jhe, makengamile kajhombe, mihoto kwakolela.” <verse eid="JOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6" />Nambo Lahabo akibha abhahihite kunane kudale na kwayekelela mapepetae ghukutendekeya ngobho jha kitane panane jhake. <verse eid="JOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />Bhahe, bhando bheniya bhibhatumitwa na munahota nkolongwa ngabhakabhokita kwapalaha kopetela ndela jhela jhijhenda mulyomboko lya lukemba lwa ku Yoludane. Papa pibhabhokita ku kilambo chene, litangala lya kujhingilila lijhakudindwa. <verse eid="JOS 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8" />Lahabo ngabhajhendila akalingukiya bheniya kwenio ku dale kabula jha bhando bheniya kugholoka, <verse eid="JOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9" />ngabhalobhalila, “Ne manye kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga ampekiye kilambo chenje, tubhii na bhoghohe na kuhengeleka mwojho kwa nhwalo gwino. <verse eid="JOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" />Nhwalo tijhoine Bhambo Chapanga paghajhomicha mache gha ku mbwane jha Chamo pala punhumila ku kilambo cha ku Michile, na mangota chela chimwatendila akanahota akakolongwa bhabhele Sione na Ogu bha Akaamole pibhakibha kwiye jha lukemba lwa ku Yoludane, ngamakomalikiya njwenjwe. <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" />Papa pitujhoina tugha gheniya, tujhakubhehe leghele na ngatuhechuka hake kwa nhwalo gwino. Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ndi Chapanga jwa kunane kumahunde na pahe pannema! <verse eid="JOS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12" />Yene nnapile kwa liina lya Bhambo Chapanga kubhehe antendi ghambone nenga na akalongo bhango ngita nenga chinintendi ghambone. Mbala umbele nginyililo jha kuhobholeka kwino. <verse eid="JOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13" />Nnaghane kubhehe namwaleka ghome atate gwango na amajhe gwango na akahacha bhango na akalombo bhango na akalongo bhango bhoha, namutukoma jhe!”<verse eid="JOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" />Bhando bheniya ngabhannyangwila Lahabo, “Chapanga atukoma anda tutei jhe chela chitulongi! Anda nukuhyekujhe tikihikila kuhenga pamba, Bhambo Chapanga papakutupela kilambo chenje natuntendela ghambone.”<verse eid="JOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />Peniya Lahabo ngabhahulwiya kwa lughojhe kupete palidilicha, nhwalo nyumba jha Lahabo ikachengwitwe kwa kulombana na lipamanda lya muche gwa ku Yeliko.<verse eid="JOS 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Ngabhalobholila, “Nnyende mukakihiye kukitombe kupala bhala bhibhampalaha bhakoto kummona. Ntame kono kwa machiko matato, ade bhala bhibhampalaha pibhapala kukelebhuka, pena nnyendelela na mwanja.”<verse eid="JOS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Bhando bhala ngabhannyangwila, “Kilapo chela chitulapiline natuhenga. <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" />Chenje ndi chimipa kuhenga. Pitupa kujhingi mu kilambo chenje, ntabha luhunga lukele mulidilicha pala pumutuhulukiya. Mwakonganicha tate gwino na majhe gwino na akahacha bhino na akalongo bhino pakajhino. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" />Nambo mundo jhojhoha anda apitite panja jha nyumba jhino, kunhwe kwake natukokolekelwa jhe. Nambo mundo jhojhoha jwabhi nkate jhino anda bhamengwitwe, kuhwe kwake nakibhaha panane jhito. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Yene anda munnobholi mundo jhojhoha mahengo ghituhikila kuhenga, twenga natuhenga jhe kilapo chimutunyopita.” <verse eid="JOS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Lahabo ngajhangwila, “Naibhaha ngita chinnongile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 2:21">Yene ngabhatabhukina, ngabhajhawila. Na jwene ngatabha lughojhe lukele mulidilicha.<verse eid="JOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Akalingukiya bheniya ngabhajhenda ku itombe. Na kwono ngabhatamita kwa machiko matato ade bhala bhubhakibhe bhibhampalaha chehemo jhoha bhakabhakolijhe. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Bhahe akalingukiya bheniya bhabhele ngabhahulwika kuhumi ku kitombe, ngabhajhombwika lukemba na kuhika kwa Yoshuwa, mwana gwa Nune na ngabhachimulila ghoha ghibhakongine nagho. <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" />Ngabhannobholila Yoshuwa, “Chakaka Bhambo Chapanga atupi kilambo chenje choha. Bhando bhoha bhilendema kwa bhoghohe kunhwalo gwito.”<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s">Akaichilahele bhijhomboka lukemba Yoludane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />Kilabho putepute lukela Yoshuwa na bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele ngabhatumbwila mwanja kuhuma Shitimo. Pubhahikita palukemba lwa ku Yoludane, ngabhabhekita kighono kabula jha kujhomboka lukemba. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2" />Pughapetita machiko matato ilongoche ngabhapetita pakate jha kighono chenie, <verse eid="JOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3" />ngabhalobhalila bhando, “Pumpa kulibhona Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ligheghitwe na akapiya matambiko kuhuma mulungolo lwa Akalabhe, mupita panja nu kulikengama, <verse eid="JOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />ndi namuimanya ndela jha kupeta nhwalo munapeta jhe ndela jhenio kabula. Nambo mangalibhandikii jhe Lichanduko lya Lilaghano, mma kutale kilometa jhimo.”<verse eid="JOS 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" />Yoshuwa ngabhalobhalila bhando, “Chonde mukijhelebhule kupala nnyeketelwe kunnyinamila Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo kilabho Bhambo Chapanga nahenga nginyililo pakate jhino.” <verse eid="JOS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Peniya Yoshuwa ngabhalobhalila akapiya matambiko, “Ntole Lichanduko lya Lilaghano, nnongolele nako nnonge jha bhando.” Na bheniya bhakatohi na kulongolela nako nnonge jha bhando.<verse eid="JOS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Yoshuwa, “Kuhumii deleno, nandumbula kwalangiya Akaichilahele kubhehe mwenga ndi kilongoche nkolongwa na mmi pamonga na mwenga ngita chimila na Mucha. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />Mwalaghile akapiya matambiko bheniya bhibhajhegha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano bhajheme muupele jha lukemba lwa Yoludane.”<verse eid="JOS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Bhahe, Yoshuwa ngabhalobholila Akaichilahele, “Ngohe nheghele pamba kujhokanikiya malobhe gha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.” <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" />Yoshuwa ngajhendelila kulongela, “Chakaka Chapanga jwabhii ghome nanabhenga Akakanaane na Akahite na Akaive na Akapeliche na Akagilgache na Akaamole na Akayebuche. Namangota naumanya kubhehe Chapanga jwabhii ghome abhii pakate jhino, <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11" />pala Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo jwa pannema ghoha, libhii pahina kujhomboka palonge jhino na kujhingii mulukemba lwa Yoludane. <verse eid="JOS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12" />Ngohe, nhaghule munalome jhumo jhumo kuhumi mu makabila kome na mabhele gha Akaichilahele, kila likabila mundo jhumo. <verse eid="JOS 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13" />Kipinde njajho jha akapiya matambiko bhibhajhegha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, Bhambo jwa pannema poha, pipakulebhata mu lukemba lwa Yoludane, mache ghighakokwa ghajhakulundikana.”<verse eid="JOS 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />Bhahe, bhando ngabhoka muighono yabhe nukujhenda kujhomboka lukemba lwa Yoludane, akapiya matambiko bhakalitwekii Lichanduko lya Lilaghano na kwalongolela bhando. <verse eid="JOS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15" />Kipinde chenio ndi kikibha kipinde cha mahuno na lukemba Yoludane lukibha lutwelii hake, nambo papa tugha bhibhajhegha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano pubhahikita lukemba lwa Yoludane na njajho yabhe pilebhita muupele jha lukemba lwenio, <verse eid="JOS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16" />mache gheniya ghighakokwila kuhumii kundumba na ghajhakulundikana pahina na muche gwa Adamo ghubhii pahina na kubomane jhu ku Saletane. Mache gheniya ghighakokwa kujhenda ku mbwane jha lulambo lwa lukemba lwa Yoludane, yane mbwane jha Mwinyo. Bhando bhajhakujhomboka kujhenda pahina na muche gwa ku Yeliko. <verse eid="JOS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" />Kipinde Akaichilahele pibhajhombwika, akapiya matambiko bhibhagheghita Lichanduko lya Lilaghano bhajhakujhema mulukemba chehemo nyomo ade pibhajhomolila kujhomboka bhando bhoha palukemba lwono.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="s">Maghanga kome na mabhele gha ukombokelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />Pibhajhomolila kujhomboka bhando bhoha bha ku Ichilahele, pulukemba lwa ku Yoludane, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Yoshuwa, <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" />“Ngohe, mahaghule akanalome jhumo jhumo kuhumi mu makabila kome na mabhele gha Akaichilahele, kila likabila mundo jhumo. <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />malaghila naha, ‘Ntola maghanga kome na mabhele kuhumii pakate jha lukemba Yoludane, pala pibhajhemita akapiya matambiko. Ntola maghanga ghena, na mukabheka pala pumpa kubheka kighono deleno.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4" />Yoshuwa ngabhakemita akanalome kome na bhabhele bhala bhabhahagwii pakate jha Akaichilahele, kila likabila mundo jhumo, <verse eid="JOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5" />ngabhalobhalila, “Mulilongolele Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ade pakate jha lukemba lwa Yoludane. Kila jhumo atwekela lighanga palibhegha lyake, kila lighanga kwa nhwalo jha likabila lya Akaichilahele. <verse eid="JOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6" />Maghanga gheniya naghabhaha ukombokelo pakate jhino, na yana hino pipakunkonya machiko ghighahika ‘Nike mana jha maghanga ghanga kwino?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7" />Mangota malobholela, ‘Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, pilipetichwa mulukemba lwa ku Yoludane na mache gha lukemba lweno ngaghahibhilwa kukokola.’ Yene maghanga ghanga naghabhaha ukombokelo gwa Akaichilahele machiko ghoha ghangapeta.”<verse eid="JOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />Akanalome bhala ngabhateila ngita chalongila Yoshuwa, ngabhaghegha maghanga kome na mabhele ade pakate jha lukemba Yoludane, lighanga limo lilangii likabila limo lya Akaichilahele ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghalikiya Yoshuwa, ngabhaghegha ade pala pibhagholwika. <verse eid="JOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />Yoshuwa ngajhemeka maghanga ghange kome na mabhele pakate jha lukemba, chehemo jhela jhibhakajhemite akapiya matambiko bhibhagheghita Lichanduko lela. Yene maghanga gheniya ghabhii ade deleno. <verse eid="JOS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />Akapiya matambiko bhibhagheghita Lichanduko lela, ngabhajhemita pakate jha lukemba lwa Yoludane ade pibhajhomolila kila kilebhe Bhambo Chapanga channaghila Yoshuwa kihengwitwe na bhando bhajhombwike tela. Yoshuwa ngahengita ghoha ghannaghila Mucha! Yene bhando ngabhajhombwika kajhombe.<verse eid="JOS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11" />Bhando bhoha pibhajhombwika na bhala akapiya matambiko ngabhalongolila na Lichanduko lela lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12" />Akanalome bha likabila lya Leubene na likabila lya Gade na nucho jha likabila lya Manache bhakalongalile akalongo bhabhe Akaichilahele bhabhii na chilaha yabhe, ngita chibhalaghalikilwe na Mucha. <verse eid="JOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13" />Bhando elufo alobaine bhibhakibhe na chilaha bhibhakilenganikiye kwa ngondo bhakibhe pamonga na Bhambo Chapanga ade kululambo lwa ku Yeliko. <verse eid="JOS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14" />Lichiko lyene Bhambo Chapanga nganteila Yoshuwa kubhehe kilongoche nkolongwa kwa Akaichilahele bhoha, na bhene ngabhannyokonikiya Yoshuwa machiko ghoha gha ughome gwake ngita chibhannyokonikiya Mucha mu ughome gwake.<verse eid="JOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngannaghalikiya Yoshuwa, <verse eid="JOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16" />“Mwalobholele akapiya matambiko bhibhaghegha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano, bhabhoke mulukemba lwa Yoludane.” <verse eid="JOS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17" />Bhahe, Yoshuwa ngabhalobholila akapiya matambiko, “Mmoke mu lukemba Yoludane.” <verse eid="JOS 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18" />Akapiya matambiko bheniya bhubhajheghita Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga pibhabhokita pakate jha lukemba lwa Yoludane, na kulebhata pandumba, papa mache ngaghatumbwila kukokwa ngita chighakibha nu kutwelela kabhele.<verse eid="JOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />Akaichilahele pibhajhombwika lukemba lwa Yoludane mu lichiko lya kome lya mwehe gwa kutumbula, ngabhabhekita kighono ku muche gwa Giligale, upande ghulihumi lyobha mwa ku Yeliko. <verse eid="JOS 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Yoshuwa ngajhemika maghanga ghala kome na mabhele ghubhagheghita kuhuma kulukemba lwa Yoludane kwenio ku Giligale. <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />Peniya Yoshuwa ngabhalobholila Akaichilahele, “Yana hino pipakunkonya machiko ghughahika, ‘Nike mana jha maghanga ghanga kwino?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />Mangota mwalobholela naha, ‘Bhando bha ku Ichilahele bhakajhombwike pajhomo mulukemba lwa Yoludane.’ <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" />Namalobholela kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ngajhomicha mache gha lukemba lwa Yoludane kwa nhwalo gwino, ngajhombwika ngita hele chateila ku mbwane jha Shamu. Ngajhomicha mbwane palonge jhino ngannyombwika. <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" />Bhambo Chapanga ateila yene kupala bhando bhoha pannema bhamanye kubhehe lubhoko lwa Bhambo Chapanga luna makakala, na mangota mipalwa munyinamila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, machiko ghoha ghangapeta.”<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />Akanahota akakolongwa bha Akaamole bhibhatamita kwiye jha lukemba lwa ku Yoludane, na akanahota akakolongwa bha Akakanaane bhubhakibha muupele jha mbwane jha ku Meditelaniya, pibhajhoina kubhehe Chapanga ajhomiche chwa mache gha lukemba lwa ku Yoludane, nhwalo gwa Akaichilahele bhajhomboke. Ngabhabhila na bhoghohe na kuhengeleka mwojho kwa kujhoghopa kukomana na Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujhingii jando kwa Akaichilahele kwenio ku Giligale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Kipinde chene Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Yoshuwa, “Nnenganikiye ihembe inonoho ya lighanga namajhingiya jando Akaichilahele bhangajhingila jando.” <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />Yoshuwa ngalenganikiya ihembe ya maghanga manonoho hake na kwajhingiya jando Akaichilahele kwenio ku Gibea Haalalote. <verse eid="JOS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4" />Nhwalo gwa kwajhingiya jando Akaichilahele ndi ghongo, akanalome bhoha bha Akaichilahele, bhubhahumita ku kilambo cha ku Michile na yaka yabhe ikibha tela kujhenda kungondo, bhoha ngabhawilila umwanja pibhakibha munjenga kuhumi ku kilambo chaku Michile. <verse eid="JOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5" />Bhando bhoha bhubhabhokila ku kilambo chu ku Michile bhakajhingi jando, nambo bhala bhoha bhubhabhelukwi undela kwenio kunjenga bhakajhingi jhe jando. <verse eid="JOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6" />Akaichilahele ngabhatyangita kunjenga kwa yaka elufo ncheche ku njenga na akanalome bhoha bhubhakibha na yaka tela ya kujhenda kungondo ngabhakomelekelwa, nhwalo bhakannyokaniki jhe Bhambo. Bhambo Chapanga akabhalaghile bhando bheniya nabhajhingi ng'o mu kilambo chambone chikibholile kwakulema nu kukoleka, chabhalaghila akatate bhabhe kubhehe nabhapela. <verse eid="JOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7" />Yene yana ya bhando bheniya Chapanga ngaitunjita pakate jhabhe, bheniya ndi Yoshuwa akabhajhingiye jando, bhajhingii jhe jando nhwalo kipinde chela bhakibha umwanja kunjenga.<verse eid="JOS 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" />Akanalome bhoha pubhajhomolila kujhingii jando ngabhatamita mu kighono ade pibhalamita. <verse eid="JOS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" />Bhambo Chapanga pannobholila Yoshuwa, “Deleno nimmohingine hone jha ubhanda jhimukibha najho pumuhumita ku Michile.” Yene chehemo jhene ade deleno pikemwa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char></note>Giligale mana jhake kubhoka.<verse eid="JOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />Akaichilahele pubhabhekita kighono kwenio ku Giligale ngabhabhekita unyagho gwa Pachaka kimiye jha lichiko lya kome na ncheche lya mwehe pandika jha ku Yeliko. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />Lichiko likengima pupetita unyagho gwa Pachaka, lukela jhake ngabhalila mabumunda ghangalekelwa ngedule na ndolotolo ya mahuno gha kilambo chene. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" />Kuhumi lichiko pibhalila mahuno gha Kilambo, Akaichilahele bhakalii ng'o chakulya chikikemwa mana kabhele. Nambo chaka chene Akaichilahele ngabhalila mahuno gha kilambo cha ku Kanaane.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa na nkomana ngondo nkolo jwa Bhambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />Lichiko limo Yoshuwa pakibha pahina na muche gwa ku Yeliko, pwitu ngammonita mundo ajhemite palonge jhake, akamwiii upanga. Yoshuwa ngannyendila na kunkonya, “Mwe ndi malikoko amu majhito?”<verse eid="JOS 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" />Ngajhangwila, “Ne jwii jhe hilu na likoko jhe, nambo nenga ndi nkomana ngondo jwa Bhambo Chapanga, nambo ngohe mmii pamba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 5:14">Yoshuwa ngatama makilikite kwa ichima na kunkonya, “Mabhambo gwango, ngohe ne natumiche bhino umbala ndende nike?”<verse eid="JOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" />Nkomana ngondo jwa Bhambo Chapanga ngajhangwila, “Hula maghubache ghino, pummile panyahinyahi.” Na Yoshuwa ngateila yene.<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="s">Akaichilahele bhipukila muche gwa Yeliko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />Milyango jha kujhingilila ku muche gwa ku Yeliko ngaidinditwa nganganga na kulondwa kupala kuhibhikiliya Akaichilahele bhakoto kujhingila mweno. Akibha jhe mundo jhojhoha jwajhingila hilu kupita. <verse eid="JOS 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Yoshuwa, “Ngohe muche gwa ku Yeliko pamonga na munahota nkolongwa gwake na akakomana ngondo bhoha nabhabha mulongoche gwino. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />Mwenga na bhando bhala bhubhabhii na chilaha, namuuntindila muche gwenio mala jhimo kila lichiko kwa machiko chita. <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" />Na akapiya matambiko chaba kongo bhabhii na mapenenga ghabhe gha manyelo gha limbelele lyankambako, nabhalongolela palonge jha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano. Mu lichiko lya chaba namtindila muche gwenio mala chaba na akapiya matambiko bhapeta kujhemba mapenenga. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />Pibhapa kujhemba mapenenga gheniya kanonowa na papa pumpakujhoha lilobhe lyenio, bhando bhoha nabhachobhela kanonowa na mapamanda gha muche gwenio naghatilukila pahe. Peniya kila mundo nabhaujhingilila muche gwenio kubhoka kila chehemo pabhile.”<verse eid="JOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Yene Yoshuwa mwana jwa Nune, ngabhakema akapiya matambiko na kwalobholela, “Ntolangane Lichanduko lya Lilaghano na akapiya matambiko chaba bhatole mapenenga gha manyelo gha lipongo lya limbelele, bhalongolele palonge jha Lichanduko lyenio.” <verse eid="JOS 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />Yoshuwa ngabhalobholila bhando, “Nnyendengane nnonge, mutindila muche, na akakomana ngondo bhandina bhina chilaha bhajhenda nnongi jha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8" />Na Yoshuwa pajhomolila kulonge na bhando, akapiya matambiko bhala bhibhabhii na mapenenga chaba palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ngabhalongolila palonge, kongo bhakijhemba mapenenga ghabhe na Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga lyakengima. <verse eid="JOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9" />Bhando bhala bhubhabhii na chilaha ngabhalongolila nnonge jha akapiya matambiko bhibhajhembita na akalonda bhange bhakengima unyuma jha Lichanduko lyenio, na mapenenga ngaghakolimbina hake. <verse eid="JOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Nambo Yoshuwa ngabhalaghalikiya bhando, “Nkoto kukema mlete gwa ngondo amu kulonge chochoha ade lichiko limbakunnobholela nchobhela, peniya nachobhela.” <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Yene Yoshuwa ngabhateila bhando bhala bhautindila mala jhimo muche gweno kongo bhajheghite Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga na kubhujha kukighono kugholoka kilo.<verse eid="JOS 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12" />Putepute lukela Yoshuwa ngajhimwika na akapiya matambiko ngabhaligheghita Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13" />Akapiya matambiko chaba ngabhatoila mapenenga chaba ngabhalongolila palonge jha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga kongo bhikijhemba mapenenga. Bhando bhubhabhi na chilaha ngabhalongolila palonge yabhe na akalonda unyuma bhalikengima Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga kongo akapiya matambiko ngabhajhendelila kukolimbana kujhemba mapenenga. <verse eid="JOS 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />Lichiko lilikengima ngabhautindila kabhele mala jhimo na kubhujha kukighono chabhe. Ngabhateila yene kwa machiko chita.<verse eid="JOS 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />Lichiko lya chaba, ngabhajhimwika putepute na ngabhautindila muche gwenio ngita chibhatindila machiko chita. Nambo mulichiko lya chaba ngabhatindila muche gweno mala chaba. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" />Pibhatindila mala jha chaba, akapiya matambiko pibhajhembita mapenenga kwa lilobhe likolongwa, Yoshuwa ngabhalobhalila bhando kubhehe, “Nchobhelele, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga ampekiye muche ghongo! <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" />Muche ghongo pamonga na ilebhe yoha ibhii mwenio naikomelekelwa njwe kubhehe litambiko kwa Bhambo Chapanga. Nambo Laabo tugha, nngongola jhola ndi nalekwa pamonga na bhando bha pakajhake, nhwalo akabhahihite bhando bhito bhibhatumita akalingukiya. <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" />Nambo mangatola jhe kilebhe chochoha chikipalwa kukomelekelwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga. Anda ntoi kilebhe chikipiitwe litambiko kwa Bhambo Chapanga, namukitenda kighono cha Akaichilahele kukomelekelwa na yene nannyambulila mang'ahe. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Madine ghoha gha feza na chaabo na yombo jha shaba na choma ndi ibhekitwe pakanjika kwa Bhambo Chapanga, ipalwa iletwa mukihukilo cha Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />Yene akapiya matambiko bhakahona mapenenga. Bhando pibhajhohina lilobhe likolongwa lya mapenenga ngabhachobhila kanonowa na mapamanda gha muche ngaghatilukina. Papa bhando ngabhaujhingilila muche gweno kila jhumo kwahumile ngaupukila. <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" />Peniya ngabhakomilikiya kila kilebhe chikibhii mwenio kwa upanga, akanalome kwa akakeghe na yana na ihokolo pamonga na ng'ombi na mambelele na maponda.<verse eid="JOS 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Yoshuwa ngabhalobholila bhala akalingukiya bhabhele kubhehe, “Nnyende munnete mwikeghe nngongola jhola na akalongo mundo bhoha ngita chimunapila.” <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23" />Ngabhajhenda na kunneta Laabo na tate gwake na majhe gwake na akahacha mundo na akalongo mundo na bhando bhoha bhubhakibhe pakajhake, ngabhabhekitwa pahina nakighono cha Akaichilahele. <verse eid="JOS 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24" />Peniya ngabhautiniya mwotu muche gwa ku Yeliko na kila kilebhe chikibhii mweno, nambo madine gha feza na chaabo na yombo ya shaba na ya choma, yene ikabhekwitwe mu kichukilo mu nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25" />Nambo Laabo nngongola jhola pamonga na bhando bhoha bha nyumba jha tate gwake, Yoshuwa akaghombwi ughome gwabhe. Laabo itama panakate jha Akaichilahele ade ngohe, nhwalo akabhahihite bhala akalingukiya bhibhakatumitwe na Yoshuwa ku muche gwa ku Yeliko.<verse eid="JOS 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />Kipinde chene Yoshuwa ngabhalaghila bhando, alongila, “Jwapala kuchenga ku Yeliko kabhele abhaha na likoto lya Bhambo Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">Mundo jhojhoha jwapala kuchenga nchinge gwa muche gweno, mwana jwa litibho nahwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">Jhojhoha jwapala kuchenga litangala lya kujhingilila lya muche gweno, nakomwa mwana mundo jwa kujhomolela.”<verse eid="JOS 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />Yene Bhambo Chapanga akibha pamonga na Yoshuwa, na malobhe ghake ngaijhenila mu kilambo choha.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s">Uhakaho gwa Akane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />Nambo Akaichilahele bhakahobholike jhe kwa ilebhe ipihitwa litambiko ikomelekelwe, nhwalo Akane ngatoila ilebhe yene ilaghilwa ikomelekelwe. Akane akibha mwana jwa Kalime, nchokolo jwa Zabude, jwahumila lukolo lwa Zela, jwa likabila lya Yuda, lilaka lya Bhambo Chapanga ngalijhakita panane jha Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Yoshuwa ngatumita bhando kuhuma ku Yeliko bhajhende ku muche gwa ku Ai, ghubhii pahina na Bete Avena, upandi kulihumi lyobha mwa Betele. Ngabhalobholila, “Nnyende mukalingukiye kilambo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 7:2">Na bhene ngabhajhenda kulingukiya Ai. <verse eid="JOS 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />Pubhakelewika kwa Yoshuwa, ngabhalongila, “Bhangajhenda jhe bhoha kukijhingilila kilambo chu ku Ai, nhwalo akolo kilambo bhene ndi bhandina. Bhando elufo ibhele amu itato bhakwela kukijhingilila kilambo chenio.” <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" />Bhahe, ngabhajhenda bhando ngita elufo itato kukijhingilila kilambo, nambo ngabhabhengitwa na akolo kilambo chu ku Ai. <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" />Bhando bha ku Ai ngabhakomita Akaichilaele makome matato na chita na kwabhenga bhange kupeta palitangala lya muche ade Shebalimo, ngabhakomila muluhelelo. Akaichilahele ngabhahengelika mwojho na kujhoghopa.<verse eid="JOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />Yoshuwa na ighogholo ya Akaichilahele nganjwepwila ngobho yabhe, bhoha ngagwila mangukama palonge jha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, ngabhahighilika pena ade kimiye, ngabhakakijhitila lutukunda umuto jhabhe kulangi ungolongonde. <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" />Yoshuwa ngalongila, “Natulola choto, mwe Mabhambo Chapanga! Nhwalo ghane mutujhombwiye kwiye jha lukemba lwa Yoludane nu kutubheka mu mabhoko gha Akaamole kupala bhatukomelekeye? Mbaha ngamutuleke kwiye jha ku Yoludane! <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />Ngohe Bhambo nonge nike, kone Akaichilahele bhatilite akamakoko bhabhe? <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" />Bhahe, Akakanaane na akolo kilambo pibhapakujhoha malobhe ghena nabhatuyema na kutukomeleke njwenjwe pannema. Ngohe nantenda nike kulonda ichima jhino?”<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Yoshuwa, “Ngohe jhinuka! Kilebhe ghane mikitaghii pahe naha? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />Akaichilahele bhatei uhakaho. Bhalitwekwii Lilaghano lyango linalaghalikiya bhalikamule, bhatoi ilebhe ipihitwa palonge jha Bhambo. Na bhajhibhite na kukopokeya, ngabhahangalina pamonga na ilebhe yabhe. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" />Yene Akaichilahele bhahoto ng'o kwahotola akamakoko bhabhe. Bhatila akamakoko bhabhe nhwalo bhene bhakitei kilebhe chukukomelekelwa! Name jhe pamonga nabheniya kabhele ade mukikomelekeye kila kilebhe chikipalitwa kikomelekelwe. <verse eid="JOS 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" />Ngohe nnyeme na malobholele bhando bhakilinganikiye ku nhwalo gwa kunnyinamila Bhambo kilabho, mana ne Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele, nilonge naha, ‘Pakate jhino ibhii ilebhe ipalitwa ikomelekelwe. Yene mihoto ng'o kwahoto akamakoko bhino ade ilebhe yene mikangila kutale!’ <verse eid="JOS 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" />Yene kilabho lukela bhoha nhika palonge jhango, likabila kwa likabila. Likabila limbakulihaghuu nalijhenda nnonge, na lukolo nandende hele. Lukolo lumbakuluhaghuu nalujhenda nnonge, nyumba kwa nyumba. Na nyumba jhimbakuluhaghula hele nalujhenda nnonge na mundo jhumojhumo. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakukolelwa na ilebhe ipalitwa ikomelekelwe kwa mwotu palonge jha Chapanga, napalwa akomelekelwa, natiniwa kwa mwotu jwenie pamonga na kila kilebhe chake, nhwalo alikamwii jhe Lilaghano lyango ne Bhambo Chapanga, nukutenda kilebhe cha hone ku Ichilahele.”<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />Bhahe, Yoshuwa ngalabha kujhimuka, ngabhalaghila Akaichilahele kuika nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, likabila kwa likabila, yene likabila lya Yuda ngalihaghulilwa. <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />Ngailetita pahina likabila lya Yuda lijhende nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ngolo kwa ngolo na lukolo lwa Zelai ngaluhaghulilwa. Helahela ngaileta pahina lukolo lwa Zelai, na nyumba jha Zabudi ngaihaghulilwa. <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" />Yoshuwa ngailetita nyumba jha Zabudi mundo kwa mundo, Akane mwana jwa Kalime na nchokolo jwa Zabudi na mwana jwa Zela, jwa likabila lya Yuda ngahaghulilwa. <verse eid="JOS 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" />Yoshuwa ngannobholila Akane, “Mwanango, mnombe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele, na peniya unnobholela hotuhotu ghunteile, mangahiya jhe.”<verse eid="JOS 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Akane pajhangwila, “Chakaka ne ndei uhakaho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele. Chenje ndi chindeile. <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" />Puniimwene ngobho alanaho jhimo kubhoka ku Babele na madie gha mbijha ghina utopaho gwa kilo ibhele na nucho na nucho kilo jha chaabo nganogwilanako nukuitola, niwininike wii pahe nkate jha mu lihema lyango na mbijha yenio ibhii pamo momomo.” Shekele ndi kipemo chibhapemila Akaebulaniya.<verse eid="JOS 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Bhahe, Yoshuwa ngatuma bhando, na bhene ngabhajhenda ade mulihema lya Akane. Ku ilebhe ikaiitwe mu lihema lyake na madine gha feza papa pahe pibhii ilebhe henge. <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />Ngabhatola nu kumpeleka Yoshuwa na bhando bhoha bhaku Ichilahele, na bhene ngabhaikutulila pahe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Yoshuwa pamo na Akaichilahele bhoha, ngabhankamwila Akane, mwana gwa Zela, nu kumpeleka mulikemba lya mang'ahe. Ngabhampelika pamonga na madine gha feza ghala na ngobho na chaabo na yana mundo inalome na ikeghe pamonga na ng'ombi na maponda na mambelele ghake, lihema lyake na kila kilebhe chabhii nacho. <verse eid="JOS 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" />Peniya Yoshuwa ngankonya Akane, “Nhwalo gwa nike mituletii mang'ahe? Bhambo Chapanga nannetela mang'ahe mabhene deleno!” Akaichilahele bhoha ngabhankong'winda Akane kwa maghanga ade kuwegha. Helahela ngabhakong'winda maghanga akalongo mundo na bhoha ngabhawila, peniya ngabhatiniya bhoha kwa mwotu. <verse eid="JOS 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" />Peniya ngabhalundika maghanga ngoo panane jhabhe, gheniya ghabhii ade deleno. Chehemo jhenio ngaikemitwa, Ling'engo lya mang'ahiko ade deleno.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 7:26">Peniya lilaka lya Bhambo Chapanga ngalipolita.<verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s">Muche gwaku Ai upukilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Yoshuwa, “Nkoto kujhoghopa hilu kupwelela chochoha, tola akakomana ngondo bhoha na nnyende nabho kukijhingilila kilambo chuku Ai. Nhwalo munahota nkolongwa jwenio nimekite njwe pahe jha ulongoche gwino pamonga na bhando bhake bhoha na muche gwake. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" />Mkomelekeya muche gwa ku Ai pamonga na munahota nkolongwa gwake ngita chimukomilikiya muche gwa ku Yeliko pamonga na munahota nkolongwa gwake. Ilebhe yake pamonga na ipugho yake impakupukila naibhaha hino. Majhobhila kuhumi chukuyeto muche gwenio.”<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Peniya Yoshuwa ngabhoka pamonga na akakomana ngondo bhake bhoha kujhenda ku Ai. Ngahagwila bhando elufo selasine bhangajhoghopa na kwalobholela nabhalongolela kipinde cha uhiko. <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" />Yoshuwa ngabhalaghalikiya naha, “Mangota namujhobhela muche gweno chukuyeto, namajhingilila. Nkoto kubhehe kutale nambo mma miho. <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />Ne pamonga na akakomana ngondo bhumbakubheniyabho, natubhaha tomitomi na muche gwenio. Bhando pibhapakubhehe tomitomi ngita chibhateila pibhatumbwila, twenga natwatila. <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6" />Yene bhene nabhachocha kutukengamila ade bhabha kutale na muche gwabhe, nabhawachila bhatubhutwiye ngita chibhateila pala pukutumbula. Twenga natwaleka bhutubhutuye. <verse eid="JOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7" />Peniya mangota napwitukila pwitu kuhumii kola kumajhobhila na kuupukila muche gwenio, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, namubheka muche gwenio pahe jha ulongoche gwino. <verse eid="JOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Pumupakupukila muche gwenio, namukomelekeya kwa mwotu ngita chanaghalikiya Bhambo Chapanga. Gheniya ndi malaghalikilo ghukukamula.” <verse eid="JOS 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Peniya Yoshuwa ngabhalobholila bheniya bhajhende chehemo jhabhe jhukujhobhela, na bhene ngabhajhenda upandi ghulitipikii lyobha lya muche gwenio gwa ku Ai na ku Betele. Nambo Yoshuwa uhiko gwenio ngagholwika mu kighono cha Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />Yoshuwa ngalabhita kujhimwika, ngabhakonganicha Akaichilahele nu kujhenda ku muche gwaku Ai, kongo alongohine na ihokolo. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />Akakomana ngondo bhakalongoine nabho ngabhaubhandikila muche gwenio na ngabhabheka kighono upandi gwa kachikachine mwa muche gwenio, kwiye jha ling'engo lya ku Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Yoshuwa ngabhatoila bhando ngita elufo nhwano na kwatenda bhajhobhela pakate jha ku Betele na ku Ai, upandi ghulitipikii lyobha mwa muche gweno gwa ku Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Lilongo likolongwa lya akakomana ngondo bhakilenganikiye kwa ngondo upandi gwa kachikachine mwa muche na bhibhahighile na bhakilenganikiye upandi ghulitipikii lyobha gwa muche. Nambo uhiko gwenio Yoshuwa ngagholwika mu lulambo. <verse eid="JOS 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />Munahota nkolongwa jwa muche gwa ku Ai palola gheniya, ngajhenda kajhombe lulambo lwa lukemba lwa Yoludane kupala akomane ngondo na Akaichilahele. Nambo akamanyii jhe kubhehe muche gwake bhakaujhobhii mandae kuhumi chukuyeto. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" />Yoshuwa na bhando bhakibha nabho ngabhatenda ngita bhatei kulepelela, ngabhatumbwila kubhutukila kunjenga. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" />Akakomana ngondo bhoha bha muche gwa ku Ai, ngabhalaghilwa bhakengemile Akaichilahele, pibhakengemila bheniya, Yoshuwa kajhenda kutale na muche gwenio. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />Pakibha jhe na mundo jwakahighalile ku muche gwaku Ai amu ku Betele, milyango jha muche tu ngauhighalika ngabhajhenda kwakengamila Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Yoshuwa, “Nnenge nkowa gwino kwenio ku Ai, nhwalo muche gwenio nubhaha pahe jha ulongoche gwino.” Yoshuwa ngateila ngita chalobholilwe. <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />Papa tu Yoshuwa pateila yene, lilongo lenge lilijhobhila upande ghonge ngalipitila nu kujhingii muche, ngaliupukila muche nu kukomelekeya kwa mwotu likituu. <verse eid="JOS 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20" />Akakomana ngondo bha ku Ai pibhaghalambwika unyuma, ngabhalibhona lyoi lihukita tututu kujhenda kunane. Nambo bhene ngabhakibha chwapuu kubhii jhe kukutilila, nhwalo Akaichilahele bhala bhibhatilila kunjenga ngabhaghalambukila bhala bhibhakengima. <verse eid="JOS 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21" />Yoshuwa na akakomana ngondo pibhalolita kubhehe lilongo lilijhobhila liupukii muche na lyoi likahuka tututu kuhumii umuche gwenio, ngabhaghalambwikila na kutumbuu kwakoma bhando bha ku Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" />Bhala akakomana ngondo bhibhakomalikiya muche ngabhabhokita ku Ai na kulombana na Akaichilahele ajhabhe, yene bhando bha ku Ai ngabhatindilwa na Akaichilahele, na bheniya ngabhakomita akahighililke jhe hilu mundo jhumo pakate jhabhe, <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />nambo munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Ai ngabhampukila ghome, ngabhampelika kwa Yoshuwa.<verse eid="JOS 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />Akaichilahele pibhajhomolila kwakomilikiya kwa upanga bhando bhoha bhuku Ai kola kunjenga kubhakengemila, ngabhabhujhita ku muche na kwakoma bhoha bhibhahighalile kwenio. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25" />Bhando bhoha bhuku Ai bhibhakakomitwe lichiko lyenio, akanalome na akakeghe bhakibha ngita elufo kome na mbili. <verse eid="JOS 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26" />Yoshuwa akanhulwii jhe lubhoko lwake lwakakamwii nkowa gwake kulenga ku Ai, ade pala pabhakomita akolo muche bhoha bha muche gwenio. <verse eid="JOS 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />Akaichilahele ngabhapukila inyama kukolekwa na ilebhe henge ngita hela Bhambo Chapanga channaghila Yoshuwa. <verse eid="JOS 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" />Yene, Yoshuwa ngaukomelekeya muche gwa ku Ai kwa mwotu na kuutenda kubhehe lilundo ngita mahundo na ukebha ade deleno. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" />Peniya munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Ai ngabhankomita na kunhoma na kunnyenjela pankongo, pipitotolo ade kimiye. Nambo lyobha pulitumbila kutipika, Yoshuwa ngalaghalikila malelo ghake bhahuluwe na bhataghila pa litangala lya muche na peniya bhalundika maghanga ngoo panane jhake. Lilundo lyenio libhii ade deleno kwenio.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilo miyono ichomwa pakitombe ku Ebale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />Peniya Yoshuwa nganchengila kachangwale kanyahinyahi ka litambiko Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele, kukitombe ku Ebale. <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" />Yoshuwa ngachengita kachangwale jhenio ngita Mucha ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga, chabhalaghila Akaichilahele, tela na chiijhandikwe mu kitabo cha Mucha cha Malaghalikilo kubhehe, “Naibhaha njangwale ichengwitwe kwa maghanga ghangabhachwa hilu kupapaywa na chombu chochoha cha choma. Panane jha njangwale jhenio jha maghanga ngabhampihikiya Bhambo Chapanga matambiko ghukomelekewa na matambiko ghange gha uteeke.” <verse eid="JOS 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" />Kwenio, nnonge jha nchambe gwa Akaichilahele, Yoshuwa ngalenganikiya lighanga nu kujhandika Lilaghalikilo lya Mucha panane jhake. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" />Akaichilahele bhoha na ilongoche yabhe na ighogholo na akakenga na akaghene bhoha bhubhakibha pakate jhabhe, gabhajhema kila upandi tomitomi na Lichanduko lya Lilaghano palonge jha akapiya matambiko Akalawe bhubhakibha bhagheghita Lichanduko lyenio lya Bhambo Chapanga. Nucho jhabhe ngabhajhema palonge jha kitombe Gilizimu na nucho jhenge ngabhajhema palonge jha kitombe Ebale, ngita hela Mucha, ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga, chalaghilwa kwape mota Akaichilahele. <verse eid="JOS 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" />Peniya, Yoshuwa ngabhachomila malaghalikilo ghoha pamonga na mota na likoto ngita chiijhandikwe mu kitabo cha Lilaghalikilo. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" />Yene malobhe ghoha ghalaghilwa na Mucha, Yoshuwa ngachomita palonge jha nchambe gwa Akaichilahele na pakate jha akakeghe na yana na akaghene bhubhatamita pamo nabho.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s">Akagideone bhinkolowa Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1" />Uhotolo gwa Akaichilahele ukamanyikine na akanahota akakolongwa bhoha bhubhakibha kwiye jha lukemba lwa ku Yoludane upandi gwa kulitipikii lyobha. Akanahota bheniya bhatamita mu ilambo ya itombe na katombe na mundika na muupele mwa mbwane jha Meditelaniya ade ku Lebanone ku upandi gwa kachikachine. Akanahota bhamba bhakibha Akahite na Akaamole na Akakaane na Akapeliche na Akahive na Akayebuche. <verse eid="JOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2" />Gabhakongina pamonga kupala kukomana ngondo na Yoshuwa na Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3" />Nambo bhando bhu ku Gibeone bhubhakibhe Akahive pibhajhoha malobhe gha Yoshuwa chaitendii muche gwaku Yeliko na ku Ai, <verse eid="JOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4" />ngabhateila nginyika. Ngabhalenganikiya yakulyegha na ngabhakwelicha maghunila ghighatukutwike panane jha maponda ghabhe na mahako ghalalite nu kuchonwa. <verse eid="JOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />Ngabhawalita maghubache na ngobho itundungile na yakulya yabhe yoha ikibha ijhomo ichonilii ukongwa. <verse eid="JOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />Bhahe, ngabhannyendila Yoshuwa kukighono chuku ku Giligale, ngabhannobholila jwenie na Akaichilahele kubhehe, “Twe tuhumii ku kilambo chukutale, chonde tujhopa mmeke lilaghano na twenga.”<verse eid="JOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" />Nambo Akaichilahele ngabhajhangwila Akahive bhamba kubhehe, “Natubheka bhole lilaghano na mangota? Pange mangota mitama pahina na twenga.”<verse eid="JOS 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />Na bheniya ngabhannobholila Yoshuwa kubhehe, “Twe ngita akatumichi bhino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 9:8">Na Yoshuwa ngabhakonya, “Mangota meneke, na mibhoke kojhe?”<verse eid="JOS 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" />Bhene ngabhanyangwila, “Twenga ngita akatumiche bhino, tuhumii kukilambo chukutale na tuikite nhwalo tujhohine malobhe gha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. Tukajhohine malobhe ghoha ghateii mu kilambo chuku Michile, <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" />na ghoha ghabhatendii akanahota akakolongwa bhabhele bha Akaamole bhubhakibha kwiye upandi ghulihumi lyobha mwa lukemba Yoludane. Akanahota bheniya Sihone jwa ku Heshibone na munahota nkolongwa Ogu jwa ku Bashane, jwatamita kwenio ku Ashutalote. <verse eid="JOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />Yene ighogholo hito na akolo kilambo bha kilambo chito, ngabhatulobholila, tulenganikiye machulupo gha mwanja na tuike tukongane na mangota na kunnobholela twenga ndi ngita akatumiche bhino, chonde mmeke lilaghano na twenga. <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Dola, mabumunda ghanga ghakibha mapyoo pitugheghita pitutumbwila mwanja, nambo ngohe ijhomite nakumelela ukongwa. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />Mahako ghanga ghakibha mayono pututweliya, nambo ngohe ghatukutwike. Ngobho na maghubache ghito ghatundingii, nhwalo mwanja utei kulipa hake.”<verse eid="JOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" />Yene, Akaichilahele ngabhalingukiya yakulya yabhe, changankonya Bhambo Chapanga kilebhe chenio. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" />Peniya Yoshuwa ngabhekita lilaghano lya uteeke lyakutama nabho. Ilongoche ya Akaichilahele ngabhakamula lilaghano lyenio.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Pighapetita machiko matato gha lilaghano lyenio, Akaichilahele ngabhamanya kubhehe bhando bheniya bhakibha pahina jhabhe na bhitama pahina jhabhe. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Yene, Akaichilahele ngabhatenda mwanja na lichiko lyuutato ngabhaika mu ilambo ya bhando bhena, ilambo yene ndi Gibeone na ku Kefila na ku Beelote na ku Kiliate Yealimu. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" />Nambo Akaichilahele bhakabuliti jhe, nhwalo ilongoche ya Akaichilahele bhakalapi kwa liina lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele. Yene, Akaichilahele bhoha ngabhalongwima ilongoche yabhe. <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />Nambo ilongoche ya Akaichilahele ngabhalongila, “Nhwalo twalapii kwa liina lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele, ngohe tuhoto jhe kwabhengwa. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" />Yene, natwaleka bhatame kupala tukoto kuhadabulwa kwa kutweku kilapo chitubhekite. <verse eid="JOS 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Chonde mwaleke bhatame, bhena nabhatutumikila kwatinii hanjo na kwateke mache.” Naha ndi ilongoche ya Akaichilahele chibhalongila.<verse eid="JOS 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Yoshuwa ngabhakema Akagibeone na kwakonya, “Bho, kwanike mutukolwii mihuma kutale kone mangota mitama pahina jhito? <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />Ngohe mukipalii likoto mabhene na machiko ghoha namma makabhanda bha kutina hanjo nu kuteka mache kunhwalo jha nyumba jha Chapanga gwango.”<verse eid="JOS 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" />Ngabhanyangwila Yoshuwa kubhehe, “Chakaka, tukamanye kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino akannobholile Mucha ntumiche gwake kubhehe, abhakomelekee akolo kilambo bhoha na kilambo chenje, kibhaha kilambo chabhe Akaichilahele. Yene, ngatuupwelila ughome gwito na ndi nhwalo ngatuteila kilebhe chenje. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />Ngohe twe tubhii mulongoche gwino, mutendela mwenga chimikipala.” <verse eid="JOS 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Yene, Yoshuwa chabhatendila ndi kwakombola kwa Akaichilahele bhakoto kwakoma. <verse eid="JOS 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" />Nambo kuhumii lichiko lyenio, Yoshuwa ngabhateila Akagibeone bhatina hanjo na kutekele mache kwa nhwalo gwa Akaichilahele bhoha na kwa nhwalo gwa kanjangwale kukupikii litambiko lya Bhambo Chapanga, popoha pala Bhambo Chapanga papahagwii ade deleno.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s">Kulepela kwa Akaamole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />Munahota nkolongwa Adoni Sedeki jwaku Yeluchalemo ngajhoha malobhe kubhehe Yoshuwa chakipukila muche gwaku Ai na kukomelekeya njwenjwe ngita chautendila Yeliko na munahota nkolongwa gwake. Helahela ngajhoha kubhehe akakolo kilambo bhuku Gibeone, bhatei lilaghano lya uteeke na Akaichilahele na ngohe mitama pakate jhabhe. <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" />Malobhe gheniya ngaghaletila kiholo kikolongwa ku Yeluchelemo, nhwalo Gibeone ukibha muche ghumanyikina hake pakate jha miche jhikibha jha akanahota akakolongwa. Muche ghongo hele ukibha nkolongwa hake kuliku muche gwaku Ai na akanalome bhake bhakibha akakomana ngondo bhangalendema. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Yene, munahota nkolongwa Adone Sedeki jwa ku Yeluchalemo ngapelika lilobhe kwa munahota nkolongwa Hoamu jwaku Ebulone, na munahota Pilamu jwaku Yalumute na munahota nkolongwa Yafiya jwaku Lakishe na munahota nkolongwa Debile jwaku Egulone, <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />ngabhalobholila, “Nhikangane undangatile kwakoma Akagibeone, nhwalo bhatei lilaghano lya kutama kwa uteeke na Yoshuwa pamonga na Akaichilahele.” <verse eid="JOS 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />Peniya, akanahota bheniya nhwano bha Akaamole ngabhabheka kighono kukitindii kilambo chenio, ngabhakijhingilila. Akanahota bheniya bhakibha munahota nkolongwa jwaku Yeluchalemo na munahota nkolongwa jwaku Ebulone na munahota nkolongwa jwaku Yalumute na munahota nkolongwa jwaku Lakishe na munahota nkolongwa jwaku Elugone.<verse eid="JOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Akagibeone ngabhatuma lilobhe kwa Yoshuwa kwenio ku Giligale, ngabhannobholila kubhehe, “Chonde tanjii kuwegha, akatumiche bhino, nhwike kajhombe mututangatile nu kutughombo nhwalo gwa Akanahota bha Akaamole kubhoka kwiitombe bhakonganike pamonga kutujhingilila.”<verse eid="JOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Peniya, Yoshuwa pamonga na akakomana bhake bhoha na bhando bhangajhoghopa ngabhabhoka ku Giligale. <verse eid="JOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Yoshuwa kubhehe, “Mangajhoghopa jhe hilu pandina, nhwalo bhabhii pahe jha ulongoche gwino, abhii jhe hilu jhumo jwapakunhotola.” <verse eid="JOS 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />Uhiko ghoha Yoshuwa ngakelwiya kutyanga kubhoka ku Giligale, yene ngabhajhingilila Akaamole kwa upwitikililo. <verse eid="JOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" />Bhambo Chapanga ngabhatweleya bhoghoye na mbwelelo palonge jha Akaichilahele, ngabhakomita bhando twe kwenio ku Gibeone kongo bhabhutwiya mundela jha ku Bete Holone jhibhii pakate jha itombe ade ku Azeka na ku Makeda, helahela ngabhakoma bhando twe hake. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" />Pibhatilita Akaichilahele muluhelelo lwa Bete Holone, Bhambo Chapanga ngabhatepetiya ula jha maghanga makolongwa kuhumii kunane kongo bhabhii undela ade ku Azeka, ade pibhakoma kwa maghanga gheniya ngabhabhila ngoo kuliku bhibhakomita kwa chilaha ya Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />Kipinde Bhambo Chapanga pabhabhekita Akaamole pahe jha ulongoche gwa Akaichilahele, Yoshuwa ngannyopa Bhambo Chapanga palonge jha Akaichilahele bhoha, ngalonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:12">“Lyobha, nnyeme nuu kwa Akagibeone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:12">na mwehe, nnyeme paling'engo lyuku Ayalone.”<verse eid="JOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />Yene, lyobha ngalijhema nuu na mwehe ngaujhema hele ade kilambo chaka Ichilahele pukilepichila kwa akamakoko bhabhe. Ngita chiijhandikwe mukitabo cha Yashele, lyobha likibha nuu kunane kwa Chapanga, mwanja gwake gwa kutipika ngaubhoghanika. <verse eid="JOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" />Lichiko ngita lyene linapiti ng'o kabula jha nnema kupanganwa na ade ngohe lyanalipitii jhe kabhele, lichiko Bhambo Chapanga pannyekitila mundo kwa ndela jhenio, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga jwenie ndi jwabhakomanila Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />Peniya, Yoshuwa ngabhujha ku kighono chake kwenio ku Giligale pamonga na Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomwa kwa akanahota nhwano bha Akaamole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />Bhahe, akanahota akakolongwa nhwano bhala ngabhatila nu kujhobha mulinkwembe kwenio ku Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Peniya, Yoshuwa ngapata lilobhe kubhehe akanahota akakolongwa bheniya bhaumbwilwe pibhajhobhite mulinkwembe lya Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />Yoshuwa ngalongila kubhehe, “Mmilimbiye lighanga likolongwa pannyango gwa linkwembe puu na mmeka akalonda papa. <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />Nambo mangota mangata jhe kwenio nambo makengimila akamakoko bhino. Majhingilila kuhumii chukuyeto hilu mangaleka jhe bhajhingila mu miche jhabhe, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, antei mahotole.” <verse eid="JOS 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />Yene, Yoshuwa na Akaichilahele ngabhakomelekiya na bhandina bhibhahighalika ngabhanyogwila nu kutilila mu miche jhabhe jhitindilwe na mapamanda. <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" />Pighapetita gheniya, Akaichilahele ngabhabhujha njelembo kwa Yoshuwa kwenio ku kighono chikibhii ku Makeda,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 10:21">Akapitii jhe mundo jhukulonge kilebhe chochoha kwa Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JOS 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Peniya, Yoshuwa ngalongila kubhehe, “Hegheya kiyekelelo cha nkwembe, kuhumii mwenio unnete akanahota akakolongwa nhwano bhala.” <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />Ngabhateila yene, ngabhanetila Yoshuwa akanahota nhwano bhala kuhumii mulinkwembe lela. Akanahota bhena nhwano ndi munahota nkolongwa jwaku Yeluchalemo na munahota nkolongwa jwaku Ebulone na munahota nkolongwa jwaku Yalumute na munahota nkolongwa jwaku Lakishe na munahota nkolongwa jwaku Egulone. <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" />Akanahota bheniya pibhaletitwa, Yoshuwa ngabhakema Akaichilahele bhoha na akolo bha akakomana ngondo bhakibha nabho kungondo, ngabhalobholila akakolo bha ngondo, “Matimbetimbe pamitandala akanahota akakolongwa bhamba.” Na bhene ngabhaheghelela na kwatimbatimba. <verse eid="JOS 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" />Peniya, Yoshuwa ngabhalobholila akakolo bha ngondo, “Mangalemdema jhe hilu kuhechuka, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga chapa kwatenda akamakoko bhino bhoha bhimpakukomana nako. Yene, mma nganganga na nkoto kujhoghopa.” <verse eid="JOS 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" />Yene, Yoshuwa ngabhakoma na kwahomeka nkongo na kwajhenjeya pankongo akanahota akakolongwa bheniya nhwano, kwenio ngabhabhamba ade kimiye. <verse eid="JOS 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />Lyobha pulibhandikila kutipika, Yoshuwa ngabhalaghila bhakanhuluye mu mikongo na kwataghii mulinkwembe mubhajhobhita. Peniya, ngabhaheghekiya maghanga makolongwa pannyango, maghanga gheniya ghabhii ade deleno.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa ipukii miche jhenge jha Akaamole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />Lichiko lyene Yoshuwa pakipukila muche gwa ku Makeda, ngankoma munahota nkolongwa na akakolo kilambo chenio bhoha kwa upanga, akahighii jhe mundo hilu jhumo. Chantendila munahota nkolongwa jwaku Makeda ndi ngita chantendii munahota nkolongwa jwaku Yeliko.<verse eid="JOS 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" />Pibhabhokita ku muche gwa Makeda, Yoshuwa ngajhenda pamonga na Akaichilahele bhoha kuujhingilii muche gwa ku Libuna. <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" />Bhambo Chapanga ngaubheka muche gwenio pahe jha ulongoche gwa Akaichilahele, ngabhakomita akolo muche gwenio kwa upanga changanneka hilu jhumo. Chibhakantendii munahota nkolongwa jwaku Yeliko na munahota nkolongwa jwaku Libuna, kikankolii cheche.<verse eid="JOS 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />Peniya, Yoshuwa na Akaichilahele ngabhoka ku muche gwa ku Libuna nu kujhenda ku Lakishe, ngabhautindii muche gwenio nu kukijhingilila. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32" />Jwene Bhambo Chapanga ngaubheka muche gwenio mukindendeke gwa Akaichilahele, ngabhakipukila mu lichiko lyubhele tugha. Ngabhakoma akakolo muche gwenio ngita hela chibhateila kwenio ku Libuna. <verse eid="JOS 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33" />Kipinde chenio, munahota nkolongwa Holamu jwaku Gezele ngaika kwatangatila bhando bhuku Lakishe, nambo Yoshuwa nganhotwila jwene pamonga na akakomana ngondo bhake bhoha ade pabhakomalikiya njwenjwe.<verse eid="JOS 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Peniya, Yoshuwa ngabhoka ku Lakishe na Akaichilahele bhoha, ngajhenda ku muche gwa ku Elugone, ngabhautindila muche gwenio nu kuujhingilila. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Ngabhakipukila lichiko lele na kwakoma kwa upanga akakolo muche gwenio bhoha ngita chibhateila kola ku Lakishe.<verse eid="JOS 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />Kubhoke ku Egulone, Yoshuwa na Akaichilahele bhoha ngabhajhenda ku Ebulone, ngabhajhingilila, <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />na ngabhaupukila muche gwenio. Ngabhakoma akakolo muche na akanahota akakolongwa bhabhe kwa upanga, ngabhahangabhina njwenjwe chenda henge jhitindii, helahela ngabhakoma kwa upanga akakolo miche jhene ngita hela chibhateila kola ku Egulone.<verse eid="JOS 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Peniya, Yoshuwa na Akaichilahele bhoha ngabhaghalambwika kubhujha ku muche gwa ku Debile nu kuujhingilila. <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />Ngabhaupukila muche gwenio na munahota gwake pamonga na chenda yoha itindii na kwa komelekeya kwa upanga bhoha bhubhabhii mwenio changahighala hilu jhumo. Chibhautendila muche gwenio ngita chibhautendii muche gwa ku Hebulone na muche gwa ku Libuna na munahota gwabhe.<verse eid="JOS 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />Bhahe, Yoshuwa ngakipukila kilambo choha na kwahotola akanahota bhoha bha chehemo jha itombe na chehemo jhoha jha itombe ichokoichoko upandi ghulitipikii lyobha na chehemo nyomo upandi gwa kuchine na mu mihelelo jhupandi ghulihumii lyobha. Kikibha jhe chikipomola chikikahighilike nambo ngakomita kila kilebhe ngita Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele, chalaghila. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" />Yoshuwa ngabhahotwila bhando bhoha kuhumii Kadeshe Baluneya ade Kugacha na ku Gochene nu ku Gibeone.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gochene jhenje chi jhela jha ku Michile</char></note> <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" />Ngakipukila kilambo choha pamonga na akanahota nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele, akakomanii Akaichilahele. <verse eid="JOS 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />Bhahe, pajhomolila gheniya, Yoshuwa ngabhujha ku kighono chake ku Giligale pamonga na Akaichilahele bhoha.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa anhoto munahota Yabine na akanahota bhange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />Yabine munahota jwa ku Hazole pajhohina malobhe gha nhotolo gwa Yoshuwa, ngatumita ujumbi kwa akanahota bhubhabhi pahina nabho ngabhajhopita bhalombane pamonga kukomana na Akaichilahele. Ngatumita ujumbi gwenio kwa munahota Yobabo jwa ku Madone na kwa munahota jwa ku Shimulone na kwa munahota jwa ku Akishape, <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />na akanahota bhibhatama mwiitombe upandi gwa kachikachine, na bhubhabhii mu ling'engo lya lukemba Yoludane jhibhii upande gwa kuchine mwa lilabha lya Galilaya na mundika jhibhii Nafate dole muupande ghulitipikii lyobha. <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />Helahela ngapelika lilobhe kwa Akakanane upandi ghulihumi lyobha na upandi kulitipiki lyobha mwa Akaamole na Akahite na Akapeliche na Akayebuche bhibhatamita mwiitombe na kwa Akahive bhibhatamita pahe jha kitombe cha Helumone mu kilambo chuku Mizipa. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Ngabhahikita na michambe jhabhe jhoha jha akakomana ngondo. Bhene bhakajholwike hake ngita nchake gwa kumbwane pamonga na mutuka yabhe jhihutwa na maponda ghamahele hake. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />Akanahota bheniya bhoha ngabhalombina ndii na ngabhabhekita kighono chabhe mu chembwe ya Melomo kupala bhakomane na Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Yoshuwa kubhehe, “Mangalendema jhe bheniya, kilabho, lichaa ngita lende nanakomelekeya bhoha kwa kubheka pahe jha Akaichilahele, namangota nhweketa micheketa jha maponda ghabhe nu kuhangabhana matuka yabhe ihutwa na maponda kwa mwotu.” <verse eid="JOS 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Yene, Yoshuwa pamonga na akakomana ngondo bhake bhoha ngabhapwitukila bheniya pa mache gha Melomo, ngabhajhingilila. <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" />Bhambo Chapanga ngabhape uhotolo Akaichilahele, na bhene ngabhabulita na kwabhenga ade kumuche nkolongwa gwa ku Sidone na ku Misilefote maimo, ade upandi ghulitipikii lyobha mu lulambo lwa Mizipa. Akaichilahele ngabhakomita bhoha. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />Yoshuwa ngabhahekita micheketa jha maponda ghabhe ghoha nu kughahangabhana mutuka yabhe ihutwa na maponda kwa mwotu, ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghila.<verse eid="JOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />Yoshuwa pabhujhita, ngaupukila muche gwa ku Hazole. Ngankomita munahota nkolongwa jwa muche gwenio kwa upanga, nhwalo Hazole ukibha ngome jha nahota yenio yoha. <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Kila kilebhe chikikibha mwenio ngakikomitwa kwa upanga. Ngabhakomilikiya njwenjwe akahighalile jhe mundo jhojhoha ghome na ngautiniya mwotu muche gwa ku Hazole.<verse eid="JOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />Helahela ngatiniya mwotu miche jhenge jhela na kwakoma akanahota akakolongwa bhabhe kwa upanga ngita Mucha, ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga chalaghilwa. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Nambo Akaichilahele bhakaitinii jhe mwotu miche jha itombe ichokoichoko, nga ghola tu muche gwa ku Hazole, Yoshuwa jwenio ngaukomilikiya kwa mwotu. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />Akaichilahele ngabhatoila ilebhe yoha ibhapukila na inyama ya miche jhenio, nambo ngabhakomita akolo muche bhoha kwa upanga hilu bhakanekite mundo jhojhoha ghome. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" />Bhambo Chapanga ngampila Lilaghalikilo Mucha, ntumiche gwake, na Mucha ngampila helahela Yoshuwa. Yoshuwa ngatembikiya ngita chalaghilwa na Mucha.<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilambo yapukila Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />Yoshuwa ngapukila kilambo choha, chehemo jha itombe na chehemo jha itombe ichokoichoko na chehemo jha upandi gwa kachikachine na upande gwa kuchine, na kilambo choha cha ku Gochene na kilambo kijhomo upandi gwa kuchine pamonga na ling'engo lya lukemba Yoludane. <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17" />Ngabhapukila na kwakoma akanahota akakolongwa bhoha kutumbulii ku kitombe chuku Halake pahina na Sehile ade Baal gade mu lulambo lwa ku Lebanone, upandi gwa kuchine mwa kitombe cha Helumone. <verse eid="JOS 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18" />Yoshuwa ngakomina ngondo na akanahota bheniya kwa machiko ghamahele. <verse eid="JOS 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" />Ubhii jhe muche ghukatei Lilaghano lya uteeke na Akaichilahele, nambo Gibeone ndo, gweno bhatamita Akahive. Miche jhenge jhoha Akaichilahele bhaipukila kwa kukomana ngondo. <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" />Kupala kwake Bhambo Chapanga ngabheke ngandako bhando bha ilambo yabhe bhabulane. Apata bhangabhone jhe kiya, bhakomelekelwa. Yene ndi Bhambo Chapanga chanaghila Mucha.<verse eid="JOS 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />Kipinde chene, Yoshuwa ngajhenda kwakomelekeya Akaanake, bhubhatamita kuitombe kwenio ku Hebulone na ku Debile na ku Anabo na kilambo choha chuku itombe yaku Yuda na ku Ichilahele. Yoshuwa ngabhakomilikiya bhando pamonga na miche jhabhe. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" />Akibha jhe mundo jhojhoha jwa likabila lya Anaake jwakahighalike mu kilambo chuku Ichilahele, nambo bhakahighii bhandina tu mu miche jha ku Gacha nu ku Gate nu ku Ashidode.<verse eid="JOS 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Bhahe, Yoshuwa ngakipukila kilambo choha ngita Bhambo Chapanga channobholila Mucha. Yoshuwa ngabhakamwiya Akaichilahele kubhehe miche jhabhe, bhaghabhane kukengama makabila ghabhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 11:23">Peniya kilambo choha kijhakubhe teeke, ngondo ikibha jhe kabhele.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s">Akanahota akakolongwa bhubhakahotwi na Mucha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />Bhamba ndi akanahota akakolongwa Akaichilahele ndi bhakahotwi na kutola kilambo chabhe choha chikibhi kulihumi lyobha jha lukemba Yoludane kuhumii kululambo lwa ku Alinone ade kukitombe cha Elimone na kilambo choha cha ku ling'engo lya lukemba Yoludane upandi kwa kulihumii lyobha. <verse eid="JOS 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />Sihone munahota nkolongwa jwa Akaamole, jwatamita kwenio ku Heshibone. Akalongwiche kutumbuli ku Liboma lyake likolongwa likibha kola ku Aloele muche ghukibha muupele jha lulambo lwa ku Alinone. Helahela akalongwiche kutumbuli pakate jha lulambo ade lukemba lwa Yaboke ndi mupaka gwa kilambo cha Akaamole. Yane ndi kulonge nucho jha kilambo cha ku Gileade. <verse eid="JOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />Helahela akalongwiche kilambo choha cha ku lulambo lwa lukemba Yoludane, kuhumii ku mbwane jha Kinelete kwa upande kulihumii lyobha ade ku Bete Yeshimote mbwane jha mwinyo na kujhendelela muluhelelo lwa mwitombe jha ku Pisiga.<verse eid="JOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Jhonge munahota nkolongwa ndi Oge jhuku Bashane, akibhe jhumo jwa jwahighilile pakate jha Akalefae, jwalongwicha ku Ashitalote na ku Edilei. <verse eid="JOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />Jwenio alongwicha ku itombe ya ku Elimone na ku Seleka na Bashane kwoha ade ku mpaka gwa Akageshule na Akamaaka na nucho jha Gileade, ade panakate jha munahota nkolongwa Sihone jwa ku Heshibone.<verse eid="JOS 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" />Mucha ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga pamonga na Akaichilahele ngabhahotwila akanahota bheniya. Na ilambo yene ngabhapekiya bhando bha makabila gha Akaleubene na Akagade na nucho jha likabila lya Manache kubhehe kilambo chabhe.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akanahota akakolongwa abhabulita Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Peniya Yoshuwa pamonga na bhando bha ku Ichilahele ngabhahotwila akanahota akakolongwa bhoha bha kilambo chikibhii upande gwa kulitipikii lyobha mwa lukemba lwa ku Yoludane, kutumbulii ku Bale gade ku lulambo lwa Lebanone ade ku kitombe cha ku Halake, kujhenda Seile. Yoshuwa ngabhapila ilambo yene makabila gha Akaichilahele ibha ilambo yabhe telatela na makabila ghabhe, <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />kilambo cha itombe na ilambo ya itombe ichokoichoko, upande gwa kulitipiki lyobha, na lulambo lwa lukemba Yoludane pamonga na mihelelo jha itombe na kilambo kijhomo upande gwa kuchine na kunjenga. Bhando bhubhatamita chehemo jhene bhakibha Akahite na Akaamole na Akakaanane na Akapeliche na Akahive na Akayebuche. <verse eid="JOS 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />Akanahota akakolongwa bhakanhotwi Akaichilahele ndi bhamba jwakibha munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Yeliko na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Ai kukilambo chikibha pahina na ku Betele, <verse eid="JOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />pamonga na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Yeluchalemo na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Ebulone, <verse eid="JOS 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Yelimute na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Lakishe, <verse eid="JOS 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Egulone na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Gezele, <verse eid="JOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Debile na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Gedele, <verse eid="JOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Holima na munahota nkolongwa jwa Alade, <verse eid="JOS 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Libina na munahota nkolongwa jwa Adulamo, <verse eid="JOS 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Makeda na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Betele, <verse eid="JOS 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Tapoa na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Hefele, <verse eid="JOS 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Afeka na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Lashalone, <verse eid="JOS 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Madone na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Hazole, <verse eid="JOS 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Shimulone Melone na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Akishafi, <verse eid="JOS 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Taanake na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Megido, <verse eid="JOS 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Kedeshe na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Yokineamo jwa ku muche ghubhii ku itombe ya Kalimele, <verse eid="JOS 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Dole ku bomane jha Nafate Dole na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Goyimu kwenio ku Gilegale, <verse eid="JOS 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />na munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Tiliza. Akanahota bheniya bhoha bhakibha makome matato na jhimo.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s">Ilambo yangatolwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />Kipinde chene, Yoshuwa akibha aghogholwike hake, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila, “Mwe ngohe ng'ogholwike hake, ihighilike ilambo ikolongwa yangatolwa kwa makakala. <verse eid="JOS 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2" />Ilambo yene ndi henge, kilambo choha cha Akafiliste na Akageshuri, <verse eid="JOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3" />yane chehemo jhoha jhibhatamita Akakaanane, kutumbuli ku kulukemba lwa Shihole ade ku Michile upande ghulihumii lyobha, na chehemo jhoha jha muche gwa ku Ekilone jhoha jhibhii upande gwa kuchine. Chehemo jhoha jhibhatamita akanahota nhwano bha Akafiliste ndi ku Gacha na ku Ashidode na ku Ashikelone na ku Gate na ku Ekilone pamonga na kilambo cha ku Ave. <verse eid="JOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4" />Akakaanane bhange bhakibha bhamela bhitama upande gwa kachikachine kutumbuli ku Ala jha ku Akasidone ade ku Afeka ku mpaka gwa Akaamole, <verse eid="JOS 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5" />helehela kilambo cha Gebale, na ku Lebanone kwa upande kulihumii lyobha mwa ku Bale Gade pahe jha kitombe cha ku Elimone ade ku Lebo Hamate, <verse eid="JOS 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6" />hele kilambo cha ku itombe chikibhii pakate jha ku Lebanone na ku Mishilefote maimo, kubhitama ku Akasidone. Ne namwete nanabhenga bhando bheniya palonge jha Akaichilahele bhoha. Mwe mipalwa kwabhaghuli Akaichilahele ilambo yene ibhehe yabhe, ngita chininnaghalikiye. <verse eid="JOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />Ngohe mmaghana chehemo jhene kwa makabila ticha, na nucho jha likabila lya Manache kubhe chehemo jhabhe.”<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhaghanwa kwa kilambo kulihumii lyobha mwa Yoludane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />Bhando bha likabila lya Leubene na likabila lya Gade na nucho jha likabila lya Manache, bhakapatite kilambo chikikibha upande ghulihumii lyobha mwa lukemba lwa Yoludane kubhe kilambo chabhe ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghalikiya Mucha, ntumiche gwake. <verse eid="JOS 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9" />Chehemo jhabhe kutumbulii Aloele muupele jha lulambo lwa kipela pamonga na lulambo lwoha panakate jha Medeba ade Dibone, <verse eid="JOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10" />pamonga na kilambo cha munahota Sihone jwa Akaamole, jwalongwicha kola ku Heshibone ade kumpaka gwa bhando bha Akaamole. <verse eid="JOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />Pamonga na kilambo cha ku Gileade, Akageshule na Wamaakati, ku kitombe cha Helimone na ku Bashane jhoha ade ku Saleka, <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />na unahota gwoha gwa Ogu jwa Akalefae bhubhahighilike, jwene jwalongwicha ku Ashitalote na ku Edilei na ku Bashane. Mucha ngabhahotwila bheniya bhoha na kwabhengee kutale na kutola kilambo chabhe. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Nambo Akaichilahele bhabhengitejhe bhando bhu ku Geshule na bhando bha ku Maaka, yene bhijhendelela kutama pamonga na Akaichilahele ade deleno.<verse eid="JOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" />Mucha akabhapii jhe kilambo bhando bha likabila lya Akalawe kubhehe chabhe. Nambo bhene bhakampikii Bhambo Chapanga litambiko lya kukomelekeya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele, gweno ndi chehemo jhabhe, ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghalikiya Mucha.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilambo chapilwa Leubene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15" />Chehemo jha kilambo chabhapila Mucha likabila lya Leubene tela na ngolo yabhe, <verse eid="JOS 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16" />kilambo chabhe kikatumbulii ku Aloele muupele jha ling'engo lya kipela na muche ghubhii muupele pamonga na kilambo choha cha pandika jha ku Medeba. <verse eid="JOS 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />Ikibha hele pamonga na ku Heshibone na miche jhake jhoha jhikibha pandika. Yane ku Dibone na ku Bamote Baale na ku Beti Baale meone, <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />na miche jha ku Yahasa na ku Kedemote na ku Mefaate, <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />miche jha ku Kiliataimo na ku Sibuma na ku Selete Shahale kwenio ku kitombe chikibhi ku lulambo, <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />muche gwa ku Bete Peole na mihelelo jha itombe jha Pisiga na ku Bete Yeshimote. <verse eid="JOS 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />Na miche jhoha jha pandika, kilambo choha cha munahota Sihone jwa Akaamole, jweno ngalongwicha kwenio ku Heshibone. Mucha nganhotwila munahota Sihone pamonga na ilongoche bha ku Midiane, yane Evi na Lekemo na Sule na Hule na Leba, ilongoche bhamba bhalongwicha kopete kwa munahota nkolongwa Sihone. <verse eid="JOS 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />Balaamo mwana jwa Beole nnondole, ndi jhumo panakate jha bhando bhibhakomitwe. <verse eid="JOS 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />Mpaka gwa kilambo cha likabila lya Leubene kwa upandi gwa kulitipikii lyobha ukibha Yoludane. Miche jhenio jhilongilwe pamba ndi chehemo pulubhii lungolo lwa likabila lya Leubene.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilambo chapilwa Gade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24" />Henge ndi ilambo Mucha yabhapila bhando bha likabila lya Gade tela na ngolo yabhe, <verse eid="JOS 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25" />ikibha ku Yazele pamonga na chenda jhake yuku Gileade na nucho jha kilambo cha Akaamole mumpaka gwa ku Aloele kwa upande gulihumii lyobha mwa Laba, <verse eid="JOS 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />helahela kutumbulii ku Heshibone ade ku Lamate Misipe na ku Betonime, kabhele kuhumii Mahanaimo ade mupaka gwaku Lode Bale. <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />Kabhele ilambo jhiikibha mu lulambo lwa lukemba Yoludane ndi ku Beti halamo na ku Betinimula na ku Sukote na ku Zafone na kilambo chikihighilike cha munahota nkolongwa Sihone jwa ku Heshibone. Kwa upande kulihumi lyobha mulukemba lwa Yoludane, na kujhendelela upande gwaku kachekachine mwa kumbwane jha Kinelete. <verse eid="JOS 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />Ilambo yene na chenda yake ndi ngabhapilwa bhando bha likabila lya Gade tela na ngolo yabhe.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilambo chibhapilwa nucho jha likabila lya Manache upandi ghulihumi lyobha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29" />Mucha ngabhapila chehemo jhenje nucho jha likabila lya Manache kilambo kubhehe chabhe tela na ngolo yabhe. <verse eid="JOS 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30" />Kilambo chabhe kitumbuli ku Mahanaimo ade kujhakanikii kukilambo choha chikibha chu munahota nkolongwa Ogu, jwaku Bashane pamonga na ilambo makome chita yuku Yaile, <verse eid="JOS 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />nucho jha ku Gileade, na ku Ashitalote na ku Edilei na ilambo ikibha ya munahota nkolongwa Ogu ku Bashane. Yenio ikibha kwa nhwalo jha ibheluko ya Makile mwana jwa Manache, na kwa nhwalo jha nucho jha yana ya Makile, tela na ngolo yabhe.<verse eid="JOS 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Mucha ngabhaghabhila chehemo jhene makabila gheniya gha Akaichilahele kilambo chene upande ghulihumii lyobha Yeliko na Yoludane, kipinde pakibha pandika jhaku Moabo. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" />Nambo likabila lya Akalawe, Mucha akalipii jhe kilambo chabhe, chehemo jhabhe ndi kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga litambiko lya kukomelekeya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="s">Kubhaghanwa kwa kilambo cha ku Kanaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />Henge ndi chehemo ibhabhujhila Akaichilahele mu kilambo chuku Akakanaane. Jwakibha mpiya litambiko jwa Chapanga Eleazale na Yoshuwa, mwana gwa Nune na ilongoche ya ngolo ya likabila lya Akaichilahele ngabhabhaghulila Akaichilahele. <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2" />Kilambo chene bhakabhaghanichilwe kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghalikiya Mucha akabhabhaghulile makabila ticha na nucho. <verse eid="JOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3" />Mucha ngaghaghabhila ghala makabila mabhele na nucho chehemo jhabhe upandi ghulihumii lyobha mwa Yoludane, nambo Akalawe akapekii jhe chehemo jhabhe pakate jha bheniya, <verse eid="JOS 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4" />yana ya Uchupo ikibha makabila mabhele, Manache na Efulaimo. Akalawe bhakapatite jhe kilambo chabhe nambo bhakibha na chehemo jha kutama pamonga nu kuluchila inyama yabhe, mambelele na mbuhe na ng'ombi. <verse eid="JOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5" />Yene Akaichilahele ngabhakibhaghina kilambo chene, ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghila Mucha.<verse eid="JOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalebo ipelwa kilambo cha ku Hebulone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />Lichiko limo bhando bha likabila lya Yuda bhakannyendile Yoshuwa kwenio ku Gilegale. Jhumo pakate jhabhe akibha Kalebo, mwana gwa Yefune lungolo jwa Akenize ngalongila, “Mwe umanye kilebhe Bhambo Chapanga channobholile Mucha, ntumiche jwa Chapanga, jwa ku Kadeshe Belinea nhwalo gwino mwenga na nenga. <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" />Pinikibha na yaka makome ncheche, Mucha ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga ngandumita kuhuma Kadeshe Balineya, kujhenda kukilingukiya kilambo chenje. Na nenga pamujhita nganinchimulila ilebhe ya kwenio ngita chinolita tela umwojho gwango. <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />Bhando bhala bhinongohina nabho ngabhahengelecha bhando miojho, nambo nenga nganinkengima Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwango kwa mwojho gwoha. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" />Yene, lichiko lela Mucha ngannapiya kubhehe, ‘Chakaka kilambo chinnebhite magholo ghino nakibhaha chino pamonga na yana hino machiko ghoha ghangapeta, nhwalo munkengime Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwango kwa mwojho gwino gwoha.’ <verse eid="JOS 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" />Nambo ngohe, Bhambo Chapanga Mucha ammekite ghome kwa yaka makome nchenche na nhwano, kuhuma kipinde palongila Mucha kilebhe chenje, kipinde Akaichilahele pibhatindilatindila kunjenga. Ne ngohe mmi na yaka makome nane na nhwano. <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" />Nambo namela na makakala ngita kipinde chela pandumita Mucha. Ata ngohe mmi na makakala gha kuhoto kukomana ngondo amu kuhenga chochoha. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" />Ngohe umbekehe kilambo chenje cha itombe ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghila lichiko lela. Mwe mabhene makajhoine lichiko lela kubhehe Akaanake, bhitama kwenio kukilambo kikolongwa china mapamanda makolongwa, pange Bhambo Chapanga nabhaha pamonga na nenga, na nenga mbala kwabhenga ngita Bhambo Chapanga chalongila.”<verse eid="JOS 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" />Peniya Yoshuwa ngampekiya mota Kalebo, mwana jwa Yefune, na kumpe Hebulone kubhe muche gwake. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />Yene, muche gwa Hebulone ngaubhila gwa Kalebo, mwana jwa Yefune jwa lungolo lwa Kenize ade ngohe, nhwalo Kalebo akankengime Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwojho gwake gwoha. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />Muche gwa ku Hebulone mandahe ukemitwa muche gwa Kiliate Aluba. Aluba akibha mundo jwamanyikina kuliku bhando bhoha pakate jha Akaanake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 14:15">Yene kilambo choha kikibha teeke changa ngondo.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s">Chehemo jhibhapilwa bhando bha likabila lya Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />Ngolo jha likabila lya Yuda bhakapilwe chehemo jha kilambo kutumbuu upande ghulihumii lyobha mwa Edome na kujhenela ade upande gwa kuchine pakibha na njenga jha Sine.<verse eid="JOS 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2" />Mpaka gwa upande gwa kuchine ukatumbuli ku kimbokotole cha Mbwane jha Mwinyo, <verse eid="JOS 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3" />ngaujhendelila kuchine mwa ndela jha Akilabimo, mu kilambo cha Sine, upandi gwa kuchine mwa ku Kadeshe Balineya. Ngaupetila ku Hesilone na kuhobhoke ade ku Adale na pena ngaupendila kujhenda ku Kalika. <verse eid="JOS 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />Peniya ngaupeta pahina na ku Asimone na kujhenda mulukemba lwa Michile, na kujhomokela ku mbwane jha Meditelaniya. Pena ndi pupeti mpaka gwa kuchine jha Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />Mu mpaka gwabhe upande gwa kulihumii lyobha ndi Mbwane jha Mwinyo ade pala piukonganika lukemba lwa Yoludane na mbwane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 15:5">Mpaka gwabhe upande gwa kachikachine ukatumbulii peniya.<verse eid="JOS 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />Nu kujhendelele ade ku Bete Hogila, na kachikachine mwa Bete lulambo lwa lukemba lwa Yoludane, ade kulighanga lya Bohane mwana gwa Leubene. <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />Kubhoke peniya, ngaunhowika ade ku Debile kululambo lwa malagho na kubhujhila upande gwa Giligale pahina na ndela jha ku Adumimo, kuchine jha kipela. Na kujhendelile ade mu chembwe jha Ene shemeshe na kujhomokela ku Ene logele. <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />Peniya, mupaka gweno ukapetile pa lukemba lwa Henomo, upande gwa kuchine mwa kitombe cha Akayebuche, yane Yeluchalemo na kujhenda kululegheleghe mwa kitombe kulitipiki lyobha mululambo lwa Henomo na kuhika pulijhomolii lulambo lwa Lefaimo. <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />Kubhoke peniya, ngaujhendelila ade kukitombe mpaka ku chembwe jha Nefitoa, mpaka kuilambo ya kitombi cha Efulone. Peniya ngaupenda na kujhenda ku Baala, yane Kiliate Yealimo, <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />kwenio ngaupendila upande gwa kulitipiki lyobha na kujhendelela ade ku kitombe cha Seile, na kopetela kachikachine jha kitombe cha ku Yelimo, yane Kesalone na kuhelelela ade ku Bete shemeshe pahina na Timuna. <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />Ngaujhendelila upande gwa kachikachine mwa ku Ekilone na kutindila ade ku shikulone pahina na kukitombe Baala na muche gwa ku Yabineele, ngaujhomokila ku mbwane jha Meditelaniya. <verse eid="JOS 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />Mpaka gwa upande gwa kulitipiki lyobha ikibha mbwane jha Meditelaniya. Jhene ndi mipaka jha chehemo jhibhapilwa bhando bha likabila lya Yuda tela na ngolo jhabhe.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalebo apukila ilambo ya Hebulone na Debile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JDG 1:11-15">Akakenga 1:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />Ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghalikiya Yoshuwa, kubhoka kukilambo cha Yuda, bhakampe Kalebo mwana jwa Yefune kuhuma kulungolo lwa Yuda. Ngapilwa kilambo cha ku Kiliate Aliba yane Hebulone, muche gwenio ukibha gwa hoko gwake Anake. <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Kalebo ngaibhengita ngolo itato kubhoka mu kilambo chene cha Anake, ngolo yene ndi Sheshae na lungolo lwa Ahimane na lungolo lwa Talimae. <verse eid="JOS 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Kubhoka ku Hebulone ngajhenda kwapukila akolo muche bha ku Debile, makacho kilambo chene kikemitwa Kiliate shefele. <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Kalebo ngatangicha kubhe apala kuntolenicha kamwale gwake Akisa kwa munalome jhojhoha jwapakupukila kilambo cha Kiliate shefele. <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" />Bhahe, Otiniele mwana gwa Kenaze, nnongo gwake Kalebo, ngakipukila kilambo chene, yene Kalebo ngantolanicha kamwale gwake. <verse eid="JOS 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" />Mu lichiko lya unyagho gwa ndowa, Akisa ngankonyita tate gwake kunhwalo gwa nng'onda. Ngaulwika pa liponda. Kalebo ngankonya Akisa, “Bho, nimpeke kilebhe ghane?” <verse eid="JOS 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />Akisa ngannyangwila, “Mbala umbele mota, umbeke chehemo jhina ubhehe nhwalo kilambo chenje kijhomo.” Yene ngampila chehemo jhina chembwe cha mache jhikibha undumba jha chembwe jha pahe.<verse eid="JOS 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miche jha likabila lya Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />Chenje ndi kilambo ibhapatita bhando bha likabila lya Yuda tela na ngolo yabhe. <verse eid="JOS 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />Kilambo kikibha upande gwa kuchine mwa Yuda kujhenda kumpaka gwa Edomo, ikibha ndi henge, Kabisele na Edele na Yagule, <verse eid="JOS 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />na Kina na Dimone na Adada, <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />na Kedeshe na Hazole na Itinane, <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />na Zifo na Telemo na Bealote, <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />na Hazole Adate na Keliote Hezilone na hele kikemwa Hazole, <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />na Amamo na Shema na Molada, <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />na Hazale Gade na Eshimone na Bete Pelete, <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />na Hazale shuale na Beele sheba na Bishiotiya, <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />na Baala na Iyimo na Esemo, <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />na Elitolade na Kesili na Holima, <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />na Sikilage na Medimane na Sanesana, <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />na Lebahote na Shilihimo na Aine na Limone. Miche jhoha ibhapilwa ikibha ndi makome mabhele na ticha pamonga na chenda yake.<verse eid="JOS 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />Miche jhikibha mwiitombe ichokoichiko kwa upandi ghulitipikii lyobha ikibha ndi Eshitaole na Sola na Ashina, <verse eid="JOS 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />Zanoa na Enganimo na Tapua na Enamo, <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />Yalimute na Adulamo na Soko na Azeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />Shaalimo na Aditaimo na Gedela na Gedelotaimo. Miche jhoha jhibhapilwa ikibha likome limo na ncheche pamonga na chenda yake.<verse eid="JOS 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Helahela ngabhampila miche ya Senane na Hadasha na Migidale gade, <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />Dileane na Misipe na Yokitele, <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />Lakishe na Bosikate na Egilone, <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />Kabone na Laimamo na Kitilishe, <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />Gedelote na Bete dagone na Namo na Makeda. Miche yapatite ikibha likome limo na chita pamonga na chenda yake.<verse eid="JOS 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />Kabhele ngabhapilwa miche ya Libina na Etele na Ashane, <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />Yifita na Ashene na Nezibo, <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />Keila na Akizibo na Malesha. Miche ibhapilwa ikibha ticha pamonga na chenda yake.<verse eid="JOS 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Helahela ngabhapilwa Ekilone pamonga na miche jhake michokomichoko na chenda, <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />miche jhoha na chenda ikibha pahina na Eshidode pakate jha Ekilone na mbwane jha Meditelaniya,<verse eid="JOS 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />Ashidode na Gacha pamonga na miche na chenda yake, ade kalukemba ka ku Michile muupele jha mbwane jha Meditelaniya.<verse eid="JOS 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />Miche ikibha chehemo jha kuitombe ndi Shamile na Yatile na Soko, <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />Dana na Kiliate sana hele ikemitwa Debile, <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />Anabo na Eshitemoe na Animo, <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />Gochene na Holone na Gilo. Miche ibhapilwa ikibha likome limo na limo pamonga na chenda yake.<verse eid="JOS 15:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />Helehela ngabhapilwa miche ya Alabo na Duma na Eshane. <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />Yanimo na Bete tapua na Afeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />Humuta na Kiliate Aliba hele kikemitwa Hebulone na Siole, miche yabhapilwa ndi ikibha ticha pamonga na chenda yake.<verse eid="JOS 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />Helehela ngabhapilwa miche ya Maone na Kalimele na Zifu na Yuta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />Yezileeli na Yokodeamo na Zanoa, <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />Kaine na Gibea na Timuna, miche yoha ikibha likome limo pamonga na chenda yake.<verse eid="JOS 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />Helahela miche ya Eliule na Bete suli na Gedole, <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />Maalate na Bete Anote na Elitekone, miche ibhapilwa ndi ikibha chita pamonga na chenda yake.<verse eid="JOS 15:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />Kabhele ngabhapilwa Kiliate Bale hele kikemitwa Kiliate Yealimo na Laba, miche ibhapilwa ndi ikibha ibhena pamonga na chenda yake.<verse eid="JOS 15:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />Miche jha ku njenga ikibha ndi Bete lulambo lwa lukemba lwa Yoludane na Midine na Sekaka, <verse eid="JOS 15:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />Nibishani na muche gwa Mwinyo, na Engedi, ikibha miche chita pamonga na chenda yake.<verse eid="JOS 15:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" />Nambo bhando bha Yuda bhakahotwi jhe kwabhenga Akayebuche, bheniya bhakibha akolo kilambo cha ku Yeluchalemo, ade deleno Akayebuche bhitama pabomane pamonga na bhando bha Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="s">Kilambo cha Efulaimo na ya Manache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />Chehemo ibhaghulilwa kibheluko cha yana ya Uchupo kwa ndela kiumbuumbu nnobhole ikatumbulii lukemba lwa Yoludane ku Yeliko, pina chembwe cha Yeliko upande gwa kulihumi lyobha, kujhendele ade kunjenga, mpaka ku itombe yaku Yeliko mpaka ku Betele. <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />kuhumi ku Betele ngijhendilila ku Luzu, ngaupetila Atalote kwenio kubhatamita Akaalake. <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />Kwenio nguhelila kulitipiki lyobha ku kilambo chu ku Akaafulete ade ku Bete Holone pahe, jha upande gwa kachikachine na Gezele nu kujhomoke ku mbwane jha Mediteleniya.<verse eid="JOS 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" />Nucho jha likabila lya Manache na likabila lya Efulaimo kubhoke kwa Uchupo ngabhapilwa kilambo chenie kubhehe chabhe.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilambo cha likabila lya Efulaimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5" />Bhando bha likabila lya Efulaimo kulengana na lungolo lwabhe ngabhapilwa chehemo jhabhe, mpaka gwake ukibha upande gwa kulihumi lyobha ngaupeta ku Atalote Adale ade ku Bete Holone jha kunane, <verse eid="JOS 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6" />na kujhomoke kumbwane jha Meditelaniya. Kwa upande gwa kachikachine, mpaka ngaupeta ku Mikimetati na kujhenda upande gwa kulihumi lyobha ngutindii nu kujhenda ku Taanate shilo na kwenio ngupete upande gwa kulihumi lyobha mwa Yanoa. <verse eid="JOS 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />Kubhoke ku Yanoa ngujhendelila ade ku Atalote na ku Naala, nu kuhika ku Yeliko, kwenio ngujhomolela mulukemba lwa Yoludane. <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />Kubhoke ku Tapua, mpaka ghujhenda upande gwa kulitipiki lyobha ade kulukemba lwa Kana nu kujhomoke kumbwane jha Meditelaniya. Chenio ndi kilambo chibhapilwa bhando bha likabila lya Efulaimo kulengana nu lungolo lwabhe, <verse eid="JOS 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />pamonga na miche jhoha na chenda ibhabhekwila kunhwalo gwa nucho jha likabila lya Manache. <verse eid="JOS 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" />Nambo bhando bha Akaefulaimo bhakabhengitii jhe Akaakanane bhibhatama ku Gezele. Akaakanane bheniya ngibhajhenda kutama pakate jha Akaefulaimo ade deleno, ngabhahengita mahengo ngita akabhanda bha Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="s">Kilambo cha Manache upandi kulitipikii lyobha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />Bhando bha likabila lya Manache, jwakibha mwana jwa litibho jwa Uchupo. Helahela ngabhapilwa chehemo jhabhe kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole. Makile, mwana jwa litibho jwa Manache, tate mundo Gileade, ngapilwa ilambo ya ku Gileade na ku Bashane, nhwalo ajhogwipa jhe ngondo. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />Bhange bhibhahighilike bha likabila lya Manache ngabhapilwa chehemo jhabhe kulengana na ngolo yabhe. Ngolo yenie ikibha ya Abiezele na Heleke na Asiliele na Shekemo na Hefele na Shemida, bheniya bhoha bhakibha ibheluko inalome ya Manache, mwana jwa Uchupo. <verse eid="JOS 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />Nambo Selofehade, mwana gwa Hefele, mwana gwa Gileade, mwana jwa Makile na mwana jwa Manache, bhakapapite jhe yana inalome, nambo ngabhapapita yana ikeghe tugha, mahina ghabhe ghakibha Mala na Noa na Hogila na Milika na Tiliza. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" />Achikabhale bheniya ngabhannyendila mpiya litambiko Eleazale na Yoshuwa, mwana gwa Nune, na ilongoche bhange ngabhalongolila kubhehe, “Bhambo Chapanga ngannaghila Mucha atubhaghulile na twe twabhoha kilambo ngita chabhabhaghulile akanalome bha likabila lito.” Yene nkengama nhwilo gwa Bhambo Chapanga, Yoshuwa ngabhabhaghulila chehemo jhabhe ngita chabhapila akanalome bha likabila lyabhe. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Yene ndi likabila lya Manache chilinjonjwikiwa chehemo jhenge yane kilambo cha ku Gileade na Bashane chikibhi upande ghulihumii lyobha mwa lukemba lwa Yoludane, <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />nhwalo achikabhale bhamba bha Selofehade bha likabila lya Manache ngabhapilwa chehemo yabhe ngita akanalome bha likabila lyabhe chibhapilwa. Kilambo cha Gileade ngikipilwa kibheluko chenge cha akanalome bha likabila lya Manache. <verse eid="JOS 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7" />Kilambo cha likabila lya Manache kikatumbuli ku Ashele nu kujhenda ade ku Mikimetate kwa upandi ghulihumi lyobha mwa Shekemo, kabhele mpaka gwake ngaujhendelila kuchine ade kilambo cha bhando bha ku Ene tapua. <verse eid="JOS 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8" />Kilambo cha Tapua kikibha cha Manache, nambo muche gwa Tapua, gwenio ukibha mumpaka, ukibha gwa yana ya Efulaimo. <verse eid="JOS 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />Mpaka gwenio gwa Manache ngauhelila ade kukipela cha Kana. Miche jhiikibha kuchine jha Kana, ikibha jha Akaefulaimo pamonga nu kubhehe mu likabila lya Manache. Kabhele mpaka ukapitite upande gwa kachikachine mwa kipela cha Kana nu kujhomoke ku mbwane jha Mediteleniya. <verse eid="JOS 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Upande gwa kuchine ndi likibha likabila lya Efulaimo na upandi gwa kachikachine ndi likibha likabila lya Manache, mpaka gwake ukibha mbwane jha Meditelaniya ku upandi ghulitipikii lyobha. Likabila lya Ashele likibha upandi gwa kachikachine mwa mulitipikii lyobha mwa Manache na kachikachine upandi gwa kulihumii lyobha mwa likabila lya Ichakale. <verse eid="JOS 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Helahela mu kilambo cha likabila lya Ichakale na likabila lya Ashele, likabila Manache ngilipilwa ilambo ya lya Betesheane na Ibuleamu pamonga na chenda yake na miche jha Dole na Enidole na Taanake na chenda jhake Megido na chenda jhake. <verse eid="JOS 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" />Nambo ibheluko ya Manache bhakahotwii jhe kwabhenga akolo miche bheniya, Akakanaane ngabhajhendelila kutama mwenio, <verse eid="JOS 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />pamonga na Akaichilahele kubhehe na makakala hake, bhakahotwi jhe kwabhenga nambo ngabhahengicha mahengo kwa kwachokolekeya.<verse eid="JOS 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likabila lya Efulaimo na Manache bha kulitipikii lyobha bhijhonjekelwa ilambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />Bhando bha kibheluko cha Uchupo ngabhannyendila Yoshuwa, na kunnobholela, “Kilebhe ghane mutubhaghuli chehemo jhimo ndo jha kilambo kone twe Bhambo Chapanga atupii mota jhukubhelekana hake?”<verse eid="JOS 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Yoshuwa ngabhajhangwila, “Anda mmelikine naha, ata kilambo cha itombe ya ku Efulaimo kinkwela jhe kabhele, bhahe, nnyendengane mu chaghila mu kilambo cha Akapeliche na cha Akalefaye, mukakeche chaghila chenie na kitamo chino kibhaha mwenio.”<verse eid="JOS 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" />Na bhene ngabhannyangwila, “Chakaka kilambo chenje cha itombe kitukwela jhe, ata yene bhala Akakanaane bhoha bhibhatama mundika bhibhabhii na mutuka ghakatengenichwe kwa choma, helahela bhoha bhibhatama ku Bete Sheane pamonga na chenda jhake na bhala bhibhatama mu lulambo lwaku Yezileele.”<verse eid="JOS 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Bhahe, Yoshuwa ngailobholila yana ya Uchupo, yane likabila lya Efulaimo na Manache, “Chakaka mangota nnyolokine na mmi na makakala hake. Ihalala jhe kubhehe na chehemo jhimo tugha, <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" />nambo hele kilambo cha itombe nakibhaha chino. Pamo nakubhehe litogholo nakibhaha chino, namukecha nukubhujhii choha kuhuma upandi ghongo ade upandi ghonge. Nhwalo mwe namabhenga Akakanaane, pamo nukubhehe na mutuka itengenichwe kwa choma na makakala.”<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s">Makabila ghange ghipelwa kilambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1" />Pibhakihotwila kilambo chela, bhando bhoha bha ku Ichilahele ngabhakonganika ku Shilo na ngabhajhemika Lihema lya kukonganikila. <verse eid="JOS 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2" />Peniya ngaghahighilika makabila chaba gha Akaichilahele, gheniya ghakibha ghamela kupelwa chehemo jhabhe jha kilambo. <verse eid="JOS 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" />Yene Yoshuwa ngabhalobhalila Akaichilahele, “Bho, nanchelukiya ade ligha kujhenda kutola kilambo kubhehe chino champila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa akahoko bhino? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Nhaghule bhando bhatato kuhuma kila mu likabila, mbala nantume mu kilambo choha bhakalingukiye nu kuchola lamane jha chehemo jhipala kubhehe jhabhe, kubhoke peniya bhaika bhannobholela. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5" />Na bhene nabhabhaghana kilambo chene chehemo chaba. Likabila lya Yuda naliighalika na chehemo jhake kwa upande gwa kuchine na makabila gha Uchupo naghabhaha kwa upande gwa kachikachine. <verse eid="JOS 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6" />Nnenganikiya mbone nhwalo gwa chehemo chaba na unnetela. Ne nahaghulila kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito, nhwalo gwa chehemo jha kila likabila lino. <verse eid="JOS 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" />Nambo Akalawe nabhapata jhe chehemo jhojhoha panakate jhino, nhwalo chehemo jhabhe ndi kuntumikila Bhambo Chapanga kwa kumpikiya litambiko. Gade na Leubene na nucho jha likabila lya Manache ngabhapatita chehemo jhabhe kwa upandi ghulihumi lyobha mwa lukemba lwa ku Yoludane. Ngabhapilwa chehemo jhenje na Mucha, ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Bhahe, bhando bheniya ngabhatumbwila mwanja kujhenda kukilingukiya kilambo chenie. Kabula jha kujhenda, Yoshuwa ngabhalaghila, “Nnyendengane mu kilambo choha nukujhandika malobhe tela kunhwalo gwa kilambo chene, peniya mmujhangana kunjimulila, nanenga nahaghula palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, papa pa Shilo kunhwalo jha chehemo jhimpakupelwa.” <verse eid="JOS 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Akanalome bheniya ngabhakitindila mu kilambo choha, ngabhajhandika malobhe hotuhotu chehemo chaba pamonga na miche jhake, peniya ngabhabhujhita kwa Yoshuwa kola kukighono chuku Shilo. <verse eid="JOS 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" />Kwenio ku Shilo, Yoshuwa ngahagwila kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole chehemo yene palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ngabhabhaghulila Akaichilahele, kila likabila na chehemo jhake.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilambo cha likabila lya Benyamine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />Likabila lyukutumbula kupelwa kilambo chabhe kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole likibha, likabila lya Benyamine, lungolo kwa lungolo. Kilambo chabhe chibhapilwa kikibha pakate jha likabila lya Yuda na makabila gha Uchupo. <verse eid="JOS 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />Kwa upandi gwa kachikachine mpaka gwake ukatumbulii mulukemba lwa ku Yoludane nu kupetela upandi gwa kachikachine mwa ku Yeliko na kilambo choha chiitombe, kujhendelela upandi ghulitipikii lyobha ade mu njenga jha ku Bete Avene. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />Kuhumii kwenio, mupaka gwake ghaujhenda upandi gwa kuchine mwa Luzu, hele ikemitwa Betele ade ku Ataloti Adale, mukitombe chikibhii upandi gwa kuchine mwa Bete holone jha Pahe. <verse eid="JOS 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />Upandi ghulitipikii lyobha mwa kitombe chene chikibhi kuchine mwa Bete holone mpaka ngautindila kujhenda upandi gwa kuchine mwa Kiliate baale, hele ukemwa Kiliate Yealimu, muche gwenio ndi gwa likabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />Upandi gwa kuchine mupaka gwake ukatumbulii ku muche gwa Kiliate Yealimu, na kujhenda ade ku chembwe cha mache gha Nafutoa. <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />Peniya, ngauhelila kupete muupele jha kitombe pahina na ling'engo lya mwana jwa Hinomu, lyenio libhii upande gwa kachikachine nkate mwa ling'engo lya Akalefei. Kabhele mupaka nguhelela kujhenda muling'engo lya Hinomu, kuupande gwa kuchine mwa itombe ya Akayebuche, ngujhendilila ade ku Ene Logele. <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />Kwenio mupaka ngautindila kujhenda kachikachine nu kujhendelela ade ku Eni Shemeshi, ngaupetila ku Gelilote pahina na ndela jha ku Adimimo nu kuhelela ade ku lighanga lya Bohane, mwana gwa Leubene. <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />Ngaujhendelila upandi gwa luhelelo lwa kachikachine mwa Bete Alaba nu kupehekeya kwenio ku lulambo mu lukemba lwa Yoludane. <verse eid="JOS 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />Kabhele ngaujhendelila kwa upandi gwa kachikachine mwa kitombe cha ku Bete hogila nu kupehekeya Mbwane jha Mwinyo, chehemo pulujhingilila lukemba lwa Yoludane. Gwenio ndi mpaka gwake kwa upandi gwa kuchine. <verse eid="JOS 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />Lukemba lwa Yoludane ndi ukibha mpaka gwake kwa upandi kulihumii lyobha. Ndi chibhapakina ilambo ibhapatita lungolo lwa likabila lya Benjamine.<verse eid="JOS 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />Miche jha ngolo ya likabila lya Benjamine ikibha ndi Yeliko na Bete hogila na Emeki kesisi, <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />Bete Alaba na Zemalaimo na Betele, <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />Avimo na Pala na Ofula, <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />Kefaleamone na Ofuni na Geba. Miche jhoha jhibhapilwa ikibha likome limo na ibhele pamonga na chenda yake. <verse eid="JOS 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />Miche jhenge ikibha ndi Gibeone na Lama na Beelote, <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />Misipa na Kefila na Moza, <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />Lekemo na Ilipeele na Talala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />Zela na Haelefo na Yebuche helahela ukemitwa Yeluchalemo na Gibeya na Kiliate Yealimo. Miche jhoha jhibhapilwa ikibha likome limo na ncheche pamonga na chenda yake. Yene yoha ndi chehemo ibhapilwa bhando bha likabila lya Benjamine na ngolo yabhe.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s">Kilambo chibhapilwa likabila lya Chimeone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />Likabila lyuubhele kupelwa kilambo chabhe kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole likibha, likabila lya Chimeone, kilambo chabhe kikatindilwe na kilambo cha likabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2" />Likabila lya Chemione ngaipilwa miche jha Beeli Cheba na Sheba na Molada, <verse eid="JOS 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3" />Hasale Shuale na Bala na Esemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4" />Elitolade na Betule na Holima, <verse eid="JOS 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5" />Ku Sikilaghi na Bete malekabote na Hasale susa, <verse eid="JOS 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6" />ku Bete Lebaote na Shaluhene, yenio ikibha miche kome na itato pamonga na chenda yake.<verse eid="JOS 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7" />Kabhele muche gwaku Aine nuku Limone nuku Etele na Ashane, miche ikibha ncheche pamonga na chenda yake, <verse eid="JOS 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8" />pamonga na chenda yoha itindii miche jhenio ade ku Baalate Beele, hele ukemwa Lama, mu kilambo kijhomo chuupandi gwaku kuchine. Yenio yoha ndi miche jhibhapilwa likabila lya Chimeone lungolo kwa lungolo. <verse eid="JOS 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />Nhwalo kilambo chibhapilwa bhando bha likabila lya Yuda kikibha kikolongwa kupeta chibhaghanita. Chehemo jhenge ghabhapilwa bhando bha likabila lya Chimeone jhikibhii nkate mwa kilambo cha Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilambo chibhapilwa likabila lya Chabulone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />Likabila lyuutato kupelwa kilambo chabhe kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole likibha, Chabulone kukengama lungolo lwabhe. Kilambo chabhe ngakijhenila ade ku Salide, <verse eid="JOS 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />kuhumii kwenio mupaka gwake ngujhenda upandi kulitipiki lyobha ade ku Maleale, ngupeta muupele jha Debeshete nu kujhendelela ade kikemba cha mache pahina na Yokineamo. <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />Kubhoke ku Salide, mupaka gwenio ngaughalambuka kujhenda ade kulihumii lyobha ku kilambo chuku Kisilote Tabole nu kujhenda ade ku Dabelate kuhobhoke ku Jafiya. <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />Peniya ngujhenda upandi ghulihumii lyobha mwa Gatehefele nu kuika ku Etikasine, ngupeti ku Limone nu kughalambukii kujhenda ku Neya. <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />Kwenio mupaka ngautindila upandi gwa kachikachine mupaka ku Hanatone nu kujhomoke mu likemba lya Ifutaele. <verse eid="JOS 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />Miche jhenge ndi Katate nuku Nahalale nuku Shimulone nu ku Idala nu ku Betelehemo. Kukibha na miche kome ni ibhele pamonga na chenda yake. <verse eid="JOS 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />Yenie ndi miche ibhatamita ngolo jha bhando bha likabila lya Chabulone pamonga na chenda yake.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilambo cha likabila lya ku Ichakale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />Likabila lya ncheche kupelwa kilambo chabhe kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole likibha lya likabila lya Ichakale, nhwalo gwa yana ya Ichakale kukengama ngolo yabhe. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />Na ilambo yabhe ikibha na miche jha Yezileele na ku Kesulote na Shunemo, <verse eid="JOS 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />ku Hafalaimo na ku Shione na ku Anahalate, <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />ku Labite nu ku Kisheone nu ku Ebese, <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />ku Lemete nuku Eneganimo nuku Ene Hada nuku Bete pasesi. <verse eid="JOS 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />Mupaka nguika ku Tabole, ku Shahasuma, nuku Beteshemeshe, ngujhomokila kulukemba lwa ku Yoludane. Miche jhoha jhibhapilwa ikibha kome na chita, pamonga na chenda yake. <verse eid="JOS 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />Miche jhenie pamonga na chenda yake ndi jhibhapilwa bhando bhi likibila lya Ichakale, lungolo kwa lungolo.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilambo cha likabila lya ku Achele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />Likabila lya nhwano kupelwa kilambo chabhe kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole, likibha likabila lya Achele kukengama lungolo lwabhe. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />Miche jhabhe ikibha, Helikate na Hali na Betene nu ku Akishafi, <verse eid="JOS 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />Ku muche gwaku Alameleke nu gwaku Amade na gwaku Mishale. Upandi ghulitipiki lyobha mupaka ngauika kukitombe Kalimele na muche gwaku Shihole Libinate. <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />Kabhele ngughalambukila upandi ghulihumi lyobha mwa Betedagone, kwenio ngaipakina na Chabulune ade ku ling'engo lya Ifutaele, ngaujhendelila upandi gwa kachikachine mwa Bete Emeke nuku Neyele mpaka ku Kabule upandi gwa kachikachine, <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />ngaujhendelila ade Ebulone nuku Lehobo na gwaku ku Hamone na gwaku ku Kana, ade kumuche nkolongwa gwaku Chidone. <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29" />Mupaka gwenio ngughalambukila kunyuma kujhenda ku Lama nu kujhenda ade kukilambo chikitindikilwe na mapamanda ku Tilo, ngughalambwika ngujhenda ku Hosa nu kujhomoke ku Mbwane jha Meditelaniya. Miche jhenge ikibha ndi Maalabo na Akizibo, <verse eid="JOS 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30" />muche gwaku Uma na gwaku Afeke na gwaku Lehobo. Ndi ikibha miche makome mabhele na ibhele, pamonga na chenda yake. <verse eid="JOS 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />Miche jhenio pamonga na chenda yake ngabhapilwa bhando bha likabila lya Achele, kukengama lungolo kwa lungolo.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilambo chibhapilwa likabila lya Nafutale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />Likabila lya chita kupelwa kilambo chabhe kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole likibha, likabila lya Nafutale. <verse eid="JOS 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />Mupaka gwabhe ngutumbulila ku Helefe na pankongo nkolongwa gwa mwalone ghubhii ku Sananimo, ngupetila ku Adami Nekebo nuku Yebineele Lakumo nu kujhomoke lukemba lwa ku Yoludane. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />Mupaka ngujhendilila upandi kulitipiki lyobha kujhendelela ku Azinote Tabole, nu kuika ade ku Hukoke. Nguwika ku Chabulone upande gwaku kuchine, ku Ashele upandi kulitipiki lyobha, na Yoludane upandi ghulihumi lyobha. <verse eid="JOS 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />Miche jhabhe ikatindikilwe mapamanda gha maghanga, ikibha ndi Zidimo na Zele na Hamate na Lakate na Kinelete, <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />muche gwaku Adama na Lama na Azole, <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />Kedeche na Edilei na Ene Hazoli, <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />Yilone na Migidale na Holemo na gwaku Betianati na gwaku Bete Shemeshe. Miche jhibhapilwa ikibhe kome na ticha pamonga na chenda yake. <verse eid="JOS 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />Jhene ndi miche pamonga na chenda jhibhapilwa bhando bha likabila lya Nafutale, kulengana na ngolo yabhe.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilambo chibhapilwa likabila lya Dane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />Likabila lya chaba kupelwa kilambo chabhe kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole likibha likabila lya Dane, ngolo yabhe. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />Miche jhabhe ikibha pamonga na Sola na Eshitaole na Ili Shemeshe, <verse eid="JOS 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />Shaalabine na Aiyalone na Yetila, <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />Elone na Timuna na Ekilone, <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />na Eliteke na Gibetone na Balaate, <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />na Yehude na Bene Balake na Gate Limone, <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />Me Yalikone na Lakone na muche ghubhii pahina na Yopa. <verse eid="JOS 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47" />Bhando bha likabila lya Dane pibhahobhicha kilambo chabhe, ngabhajhenda kuujhingilila muche gwa ku Leshemo. Ngabhaupukila nu kutola, pibhajhomolila kwakoma bhando bhake bhoha, bhajhakutama na kukipela liina lenge muche gwenio kubhehe Dane, liina lyene likibha lya akahoko bhabhe. <verse eid="JOS 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48" />Jhene ndi chehemo jhibhapilwa ngolo jha likabila lya Dane, miche jhene pamonga na chenda yake.<verse eid="JOS 19:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilambo chapilwa Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49" />Bhando bhuku Ichilahele pibhajhomolila kubhaghana kilambo choha, ngabhampila Yoshuwa, mwana gwa Nune, chehemo jhake pakate jhabhe. <verse eid="JOS 19:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50" />Nhwalo gwa nhwilo gwa Bhambo Chapanga, Akaichilahele ngabhampila Timunati Sela, muche gwahagwila jwene Yoshuwa, ghukibha ku kilambo cha itombe ya ku Efulaimo. Jwenie Yoshuwa ngauchengita kabhele muche gwenio na kutama mwenio.<verse eid="JOS 19:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />Bhahe, mpiya litambiko Eleazale na Yoshuwa, mwana gwa Nune, pamonga na ilongoche ya makabila gha Akaichilahele ngabhabhaghina chehemo jhene kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga pannyango gwa lihema lya kukonganikila, kwenio ku Shilo. Yene ngabhajhomolila kubhaghana kilambo chenie.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s">Miche jha kubhutukila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Kibhalango 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">Kombokela 19:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />Pighapetita gheniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Yoshuwa, <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" />malobholele Akaichilahele naha, “Bhakihaghulila miche jha kubhutukila, ngita chaninnaghalikiya Mucha. <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakunkoma mundo changanamiye, ahoto kutilila kwenio, na yene kummambala mundo jhola jwapakulepecha kwa nhwalo gwa myahe. <verse eid="JOS 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" />Jwakoma natilila pakate jha muche ghumo na kujhema pa litangala lya kujhingilila lya muche, na kwalobholela ighogholo ya muche gwenio mihalo jhake. Ighogholo yene nabhampokela umuche na kumpe chehemo jha kutama pamonga nako. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Anda abhii mundo jwapa kulepechela ankengime ade pa muche gwenio, ighogholo ya muche nabhampiya jhe mundo jwenio jwapa kulepechela. Nhwalo akankomite jhe nnyake kwa namiye, na hilu bhakibha jhe na bhulo kuhumi makacho. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />Jwakomita najhendelela kutama mwenio ade papakuhadabulwa palonge jha bhando bhoha bha ku Ichilahele na helehela ade mpiya litambiko nkolo jwakibha na ukindendeke kipinde chene ahwile. Pighapetita gheniya mundo jhono ahoto kukelebhuka kajhake ku muche ghola gwatolwika.”<verse eid="JOS 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />Bhahe, kwa nhwalo ghono ngabhabheka miche jha Kadeche jha ku Galilaya ku ilambo ya itombe ya Nafutale, na Chekemo ku itombe jha Efulaimo na ku Kiliate Aliba hele ikemwa Hebulone ku muche gwa itombe ya ku Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />Upandi gwa kwiye jha lukemba lwa Yoludane, kulihumi lyobha ku muche gwa ku Yeliko, ngabhakahagwila muche gwa Bezeli ghubhii ku njenga jhandika na muche gwene ndi gwa likabila lya Leubene. Helahela ngabhakahagwila Lamote, kwenio ku Gileade muche gwa likabila lya Gade na Golane kwenio ku Bashane, chehemo jha likabila lya Manache. <verse eid="JOS 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" />Mwichilahele jhojhoha amu nng'ene jhojhoha jwatamita panakate jhabhe, jwankomite mundo changanamiye, ahoto kutilila kwenio, ku miche jhibhekwitwe kupala akoto kukomwa na jwapala kulepechela, kabula jha kuhadabulwa palonge jha bhando bhoha.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="s">Miche jha Akalabhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1" />Pubhakibha kwenio ku Shilo ku kilambo cha ku Kanaane ilongoche ya ngolo jha Akalabhe ngabhannyendila mpiya litambiko Eleazale na Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nune, na ilongoche ya ngolo jha makabila yoha ya Akaichilahele, <verse eid="JOS 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2" />ngabhannobholila, “Bhambo Chapanga akannaghalikiye Mucha tipelwa miche jha kutama na chehemo jhambone jhakukoleka inyama hito.” <verse eid="JOS 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Yene, ngita Bhambo Chapanga chalaghila, Akaichilahele ngabhapila Akalabhe chehemo jha kutama na chehemo jhambone jhukukoleka.<verse eid="JOS 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />Lukolo lwa kutumbula kupelwa muche kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole lukibha lukolo lwa Akakohate. Panakate jhabhe bhabhelukwa bha mpiya litambiko Alune, ngabhapilwa kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole, miche jhikibha chehemo jha makabila gha Yuda na Chimeone na Benyamine. Miche jhibhapilwa ikibha kome na mitato. <verse eid="JOS 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />Bhando bha lungolo lwa Akakohate bhubhahighilike ngabhapilwa miche kome jhikibha chehemo jha makabila gha Efulaimo na Dane, na chehemo jha nucho jha likabila lya Manache upandi ghulitipiki lyobha.<verse eid="JOS 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />Bhando bha lungolo lwa Gelishone ngabhapilwa kwa kiumbuumbu nnobhole miche kome na mitato, chehemo jha makabila gha Ichakale na Ashele na Nafutale upandi ghulitipikii lyobha, na chehemo jha nucho jha likabila lya Manache kwenio ku Bashane upandi ghulihumi lyobha.<verse eid="JOS 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Lungolo lwa bhando bha Melale ngabhapilwa miche kome na mibhele, chehemo jha makabila jha Leubene na Gade na Zebulone.<verse eid="JOS 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />Akaichilahele ngabhapila Akalabhe miche jhene pamonga na chehemo jha kukoleka inyama, ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghalikiya Mucha.<verse eid="JOS 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9" />Ghanga ndi mahina gha miche kuhuma chehemo jha likabila lya Yuda na Chimeone ghighapilwa kwa, <verse eid="JOS 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10" />kibheluko cha mpiya litambiko Alone, bhubhakibha bhando bha lungolo lwa Kohate jwakibha jwa likabila lya Labhe. Chehemo jhabhe bhakalongolile kupata, nhwalo kiumbuumbu nnobhole chabhe kikibha chukutumbula. <verse eid="JOS 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" />Ngabhapilwa Kiliate Aliba hele ikemitwa Hebulone, pamonga na chehemo yukukoleka inyama jhitindile mu kilambo cha itombe yuku Yuda. Aliba akibha tate gwake Anake. <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />Nambo nng'onda gwa muche gwene pamonga na chenda jhitindile, ngapilwa Kalebo, mwana gwa Yefune ibhe yake.<verse eid="JOS 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13" />Yene kibheluko cha mpiya litambiko Alune, ngabhapilwa ku Hebulone hele ukibha muche gwa kubhutukila, helahela ngabhapilwa muche gwa Libina pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela inyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14" />ku Yatile pamonga chehemo jhake jhukulekela, Eshitemoa pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela inyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15" />ku Holoni pamonga chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama, ku Debile pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16" />Aini pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama, Yuta pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama na Bete shemeshi pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama. Miche yoha jhibhii jha makabila gha Chimeone na Yuda, ikibha ticha. <verse eid="JOS 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17" />Kuhumi mu likabila lya Benyamine mu kibheluko cha Alune, ngabhapilwa miche jhenje, Gibione na Geba pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela inyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18" />ku Anatoti pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela, Alimone pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela. Miche jhoha jhibhapilwa ikibha ncheche. <verse eid="JOS 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Miche jhoha jhibhapilwa ibheluko ya Alune bhibhakibha akapiya matambiko, ikibha miche kome na mitato, pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela.<verse eid="JOS 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />Ngolo henge ya Akakohate, hele Akalabhe, ngabhapilwa miche kuhumi mu likabila lya Efulaimo. <verse eid="JOS 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21" />Kuhumii mu kilambo cha itombe yaku Efulaimo, ngabhapilwa Chekemo, muche gwa kubhutukila, pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela inyama, na ku Gezele pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela inyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22" />ku Kibusaimo na Bete Holone, pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela, miche jhoha jhibhapilwa ikibhe ncheche. <verse eid="JOS 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23" />Pa likabila lya Dane ngabhapilwa Eliteke pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela, na Gibetone pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukolekela inyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24" />Aiyalone pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela inyama na Gate limone pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela inyama. Miche jhoha jhibhapilwa ikibha ncheche. <verse eid="JOS 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />Panucho jha likabila lya Manache upandi ghulitipiki lyobha, ngabhapilwa Taanake pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama na Gate Limone pamonga na pukukoleka inyama. Miche yoha jhibhapilwe ikibha mibhele. <verse eid="JOS 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Bhahe, miche jhoha ngaipilwa ngolo ya Akakohate, yihighilike ikibha kome pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />Ngolo jha Gelishone kuhumi mu likabila lya Akalabhe, ngabhapilwa miche mibhele, pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama, kubhoke mu nucho jha likabila lya Manache, upande ghulihumii lyobha. Miche jhene ikibha ndi Golane, muche ghukubhutukila, kwenio ku Bashane, pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama na Beshitala, pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28" />kuhumi muchehemo jha likabila lya Ichakale, ngabhapilwa, Kisheone pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela inyama, na Dabelate pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukolekela inyama,<verse eid="JOS 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29" />ku Yelumuti pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama na Eni Ganimo pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama. Miche jhoha jhibhapilwa ikibha ncheche. <verse eid="JOS 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30" />Kuhumi mu chehemo jha likabila lya Achele ngabhapilwa, Mishale pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama, na Abidone pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31" />Helikate pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela inyama na Lehobu pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukulekela inyama. Miche jhoha jhibhapilwa ikibha ncheche. <verse eid="JOS 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />Kuhuma mu chehemo jha likabila lya Nafutale ngabhapilwa, Kadeshe, muche gwa kubhutukila ghubhii kwenio ku Galilaya pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama, na Hamote Dole pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama Kalitane pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukoleka inyama. Miche jhoha jhibhapilwe ikibha mitato. <verse eid="JOS 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />Miche jhoha jhibhapilwa ngolo jha Gelichone ikibha kome na mitato, pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukolekela inyama.<verse eid="JOS 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34" />Lukolo lwa Melale kuhuma mu likabila lya Akalabhe, ngabhapilwa miche ncheche kuhumii mu likabila lya Zebulone. Miche jhene ikibha Yokineamo na Kalita, pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukolekela inyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35" />ku Dimuna na chehemo jhake jhukukolekela inyama na Nahalale pamonga na chehemo jhukukolekela inyama. Miche jhoha jhibhapilwe ikibha ncheche. <verse eid="JOS 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36" />Kuhumi mu chehemo jha likabila lya Leubene ngabhapilwa, Bezele pamonga na chehemo jhukukolekela inyama, na Yahaze, na chehemo jhukukolekela inyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37" />Kedemothi na chehemo jhukukolekela inyama na Mefaathi, na chehemo jhukukolekela inyama. Miche jhoha jhibhapilwe ikibha ncheche. <verse eid="JOS 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38" />Kuhumi mu chehemo jha likabila lya Gade ngabhapilwa, Lamoti jha Gileade, muche gwa kubhutukila, pamonga na chehemo jhukukolekela inyama, na Mahanaimo, pamonga na chehemo jhukukolekela inyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39" />Heshibone na chehemo jhake jhukukolekela inyama na Yazele, pamonga na chehemo jhake jhukukolekela inyama. Miche jhoha jhibhapilwe ikibha ncheche. <verse eid="JOS 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Miche jhoha jhibhapilwa lukolo lwa Melale lwa likabila Akalabhe likibha kome na mibhele. <verse eid="JOS 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41" />Miche jhoha jhibhapilwa bhando bha likabila lya Akalabhe mu chehemo jha Akaichilahele ikibha makome ncheche na nane pamonga na chehemo jhukukolekela inyama. <verse eid="JOS 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42" />Kila muche pakate jha jhenio ikatindilwe na chehemo jhukukolekela inyama.<verse eid="JOS 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichilahele bhitola kilambo kubhehe chabhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngabhapila Akaichilahele kilambo chene choha, chabhalaghila akahoko bhabhe kwapela. Nabhene ngabhatola kubhehe kilambo chabhe na kutama mwenio. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" />Bhambo Chapanga ngabhateila bhatame kwa uteeke, kila chehemo mu kilambo ngita chalapila akahoko bhabhe. Abhii jhe likoko jhojhoha jwaghajhighite kwakunyula, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga nhabhapila kwahotola akamakoko bheniya. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" />Libhii jhe lilaghano lyolyoha lyambone lyalapila Bhambo Chapanga kwa bhando bhuku Ichilahele, lyangalenganikiya. Malaghano ghoha akalenganikiye.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s">Makabila gha kulihumi lyobha ghibhujha kajha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Peniya, Yoshuwa ngabhakemita bhando bha likabila lya Leubene na likabila lya Gade na nucho jha bhando bha likabila lya Manache upandi ghulihumii lyobha, <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" />ngabhalobholila, “Mangotamwe mighajheketile ghoha Mucha, ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga, ghannaghalikiya na kukamu malaghilo ghanninaghalikiye. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />Wala malekitii jhe akalongo bhino Akaichilahele kwa kipinde chene choha ade deleno, nambo nkengamii maha mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" />Ngohe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino abhapi akalongo bhino uteeke, ngita chanaghila. Bhahe, nkelebhuke mu kilambo chino chimpii Mucha, ntumiche gwa Bhambo, kubhehe chino, kwiye jha lukemba lwa ku Yoludane. <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" />Mma miho kukamu mihilo na malaghalikilo ghoha ghannobholila Mucha, ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga. Mupala Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nkamula nu kunkengama mihilo jhake, ntama nako pamonga na kuntumikila kwa mwojho gwino ghoha na kwa makakala ghino ghoha.” <verse eid="JOS 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6" />Bhahe, Yoshuwa ngabhapila mota, na kwalekekeya bhakelebhuke kajhabhe. <verse eid="JOS 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7" />Mucha akibha abhapii njwe chehemo jhabhe nucho jha likabila lya Manache, kwenio ku Bashane. Helahela Yoshuwa jwene ngabhapila nucho jhenge jha likabila lyene lya Manache, kwenio kulitipiki lyobha mwa lukemba lwa Yoludane, pamonga na akalongo mundo. Yoshuwa ngabhapila mota na kwaleka bhajhende kajhabhe. <verse eid="JOS 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8" />Ngabhalobholila, “Nkelebhuke kajhino kongo mmi na ilebhe mbwe, na nchambe nkolongwa gwa inyama yukukolekwa na hele mmi na madine gha feza, na chaabo na shaba na choma na ngobo yamahena hake. Mkabhaghane na akalongo bhino ilebhe yene yoha impokita kwa akamakoko bhino.”<verse eid="JOS 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Bhahe, bhando bha likabila lya Leubene na Gade na nucho jha likabila lya Manache ngabhalekana na bhando bha makabila ghange gha Ichilahele kwenio ku Shilo, ku kilambo chaku Kanaane. Ngabhabhujha kwabhe ku kilambo cha ku Gileade, kilambo chabhe bhene kwa nhwilo gwa Bhambo Chapanga ngita channaghila Mucha.<verse eid="JOS 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kachangwale kakupiikii litambiko pahina na Yoludane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />Pubhahikita ku Gelilothi pahina na lukemba Yoludane ku kilambo cha ku Kanaane, ngabhachenga kachangwale chikupiikiya litambiko kikolongwa hake pahina na lukemba lwono. <verse eid="JOS 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" />Bhahe, ngaghahikilila malobhe gha bhando bha makabila ghange gha Ichilahele, kubhehe makabila gha Leubene na Gade na nucho jha likabila lya Manache ghakibha ghachengite kachangwale kikolongwa chikupikiya litambiko pahina na lukemba lwa Yoludane, ku kilambo cha ku Kanaane, upandi gwa Akichilahele. <verse eid="JOS 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" />Pibhajhohina gheniya Akaichilahele, ngabhakonganika pamonga kwenio ku Shilo kujhenda kukomana ngondo na makabila gheniya.<verse eid="JOS 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" />Bhahe, bhando bha ku Ichilahele ngabhantumita Finehache, mwana gwa mpiya litambiko Eleazale, kwenio ku Gileade kwa makabila gha Leubene na Gade na nucho jha likabila lya Manache. <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />Finehache ngajhenda pamonga na ilongoche kome, kila jhumo akibha nkolo jwa lungolo lwa likabila lya Akaichilahele upandi ghulitipiki lyobha. <verse eid="JOS 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />Na bhene ngabhajhendila bhando bha makabila gha Leubene na Gade na nucho jha likabila lya Manache, kwenio ku Gileade ngabhalobholila, <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" />“Nchambe gwoha gwa Bhambo Chapanga ukonya naha, ‘Ndi uhwange ghane ghongo ghumunkolwii Bhambo Chapanga jwa ku Ichilahele? Mboni munemwii Bhambo Chapanga kukuchenga kachangwale kukupikiya litambiko ngita kangano? <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" />Bho, uhakaho ghututehi kwenio ku Peoli ukwela jhe? Bho, mmi kulola jhe kubhe tunakijhelebhula jhe na kulagha kongo twamela tuchumbuwa nchambe gwa Bhambo Chapanga? <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" />Kilebhe ghane ngohe chinkotwike kunkengama Bhambo Chapanga? Anda munemwiye Bhambo Chapanga deleno, na kilabho nauyomela hake nchambe gwoha gwa Akaichilahele. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" />Ajha, anda kilambo chino kijheketelwa jhe kukujhopela, nhwikangane kongo mu kilambo cha Bhambo Chapanga, kwenio lihema lya Chapanga libhile, na mangota ntole chehemo, nambo chonde mangannemuya jhe Bhambo Chapanga hilu panane jhito twenga kwa ku kukichengela njangwale hele yukipiikiya matambiko kupeta kachangwale kakupikiya litambiko kala ka Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" />Bho, Akane mwana gwa Zela palekita kuhobholeka mu ilebhe yakanikilwa, luhadabulo lwagwelii jhe nchambe gwoha gwa Ichilahele? Kabhele Akane akahwi jhe kanjika ndo kunhwalo gwa uhakaho gwake.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Peniya bhando bha makabila gha Leubene na Gade na nucho jha likabila lya Manache ngabhajhangwila ilongoche bha makabila gha Ichilahele kubhehe, <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" />“Bhambo Chapanga jwa ichapanga ndi Bhambo Chapanga! Bhambo Chapanga jwa ichapanga ndi Chapanga Jwabhii na Makakala ndi Chapanga! Jwenie amanya kwanike tutehi gheniya. Na Akaichilahele bhoha nabhamanya hele! Anda ghongo ndi uhakaho amu kuhenemuka kihobholelo kwa Bhambo Chapanga, jwene natuleka ghome mu lichiko lya deleno. <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" />Anda twalekite Bhambo Chapanga nukukichenge kachangwale kalitambiko kito tabhete kupala tumpiikiya litambiko lyukomelekeya amu mahuno ama jhe lya uteeke, bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga natuhadabula tela na uhakaho gwito. <verse eid="JOS 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />Nambo nai jhe. Tuteila naha kwa kujhoghopa kubhe pange jhe machiko ghughahika, yana hino nabhailobholela yana hito kubhehe, ‘Mangota mijhelanichwa bhole na Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele? <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" />Mmi kulola kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga abhekite lukemba lwa Yoludane kubhe mpaka pakate jhino na twenga, Mangota mwe makabila gha Leubene na Gade nkwetii jhe lipungo lyolyoha kwa Bhambo Chapanga.’ Yene yana hino ngabhahotwila kwahibhilikiya yana hito ikoto kunnyinamila Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />Ndi nhwalo ngatuamwila kuchenga kachangwale kanga, nambo chi nhwalo gwa kupiikiya panane jhake litambiko amu litambiko lyukukomelekeya hilu matambiko ghange, <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" />nambo tupala kachangwale kanga kabhaha ukombocho pakate jhito na mangota na ibheluko hito ipakuika, kubhehe twe tutumikila Bhambo Chapanga kwa matambiko ghito ghukomelekela na matambiko ghange, kwa matambiko ghito gha uteeke kupala yana ino yangaika jhe kuilobholela yana hito kubhehe ikwetii jhe lipungo lyolyoha kwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />Kabhele ngatuwacha kubhehe anda ibhi ilebhe ngita yenie kilongwii kwito amu jhe kuibheluko ito kwa machiko ghighaika, natulongela, ‘Dolekeya nnandanikilo gwa uchangwale gwa Bhambo Chapanga, yenie akanahota bhito ngabhalonge, nhwalo gha kupiikiya matambiko ghukukomelekeya panane jhake amu matambiko ghange jhe nambo ngita ukombocho pakate jhito namangota.’ <verse eid="JOS 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" />Twe tupai jhe kunnemuwa Bhambo Chapanga ata pandina nu kuleka kuchenga kachangwale ka kupiikiya litambiko lyukukomelekeya amu litambiko lya uhembe amu litambiko lenge. Tupai jhe kupiya litambiko chehemo jhenge, nambo panane jha kachangwale ka Bhambo Chapanga tugha, Chapanga gwito jwabhii nnonge jha nyumba jhake.”<verse eid="JOS 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />Finehache, mpiya litambiko na ilongoche bha bhando bhoha na ilongoche bha lukolo lwa Akaichilahele pubhajhoina malobhe gheniya gha bhando bha makabila gha Leubene na Gade na nucho jha likabila lya Manache, ngabhaangina umiojho jhabhe. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" />Finehache, mwana gwa mpiya litambiko Eleazale, ngaghalobholila makabila gha Leubene na Gade na nucho jha likabila lya Manache kubhehe, “Deleno tumanye kubhe Bhambo Chapanga abhii pakate jhino nhwalo muntendii jhe uhakaho Bhambo Chapanga. Ngohe makombwile Akaichilahele nabhakomelekelwa jhe na Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Bhahe, Finehache mwana gwa mpiya litambiko Eleazale, pamonga na ilongoche ajhake ngabhatawika bhando bha makabila gha Leubene na Gade ngabhabhokita mu kilambo cha ku Gileade, ngabhajhenda ku Kanaane kwa Akaichilahele na kwachimulila malobhe gheniya. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Malobhe gheniya ngaghahalalicha Akaichilahele, ngabhannombita Bhambo Chapanga, nakuleka kukomana ngondo pamonga na mipangu jhabhe jha kuhangabhana kilambo cha makabila gha Leubene na Gade.<verse eid="JOS 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" />Bhando bha makabila gha Leubene na Gade, ngabhakema kachangwale cha kakupikiiya litambiko, “Ukombocho,” ngabhalonge, “Kachangwale kanga ndi ukombocho gwito twabhoha nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa abhatabhuka ilongoche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />Pighapetita machiko ghamahele, Bhambo Chapanga ngabhapila Akaichilahele uteeke kwa kwaghombola na akamakoko bhabhe pandi yoha. Kipinde chene Yoshuwa akibha kighogholo jwa yaka twe. <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" />Yoshuwa ngabhakemita Akaichilahele bhoha pamonga na ilongoche na akahoko bhabhe na akakenga na akatumiche bhabhe, ngabhalobhalila naha, “Ngohe ne nakighogholo na mmi yaka twe. <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />Mangota nnolite mambu ghoha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino yatendile ilambo yene yoha kwa nhwalo gwino. Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ndi jwankomanile. <verse eid="JOS 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />Nkomboka ilambo ihighilike na yela yangaikomelekeya nimmaghulile kubhehe chehemo jha makabila ghino, ilambo inihotwile. Kuhumi ku Yoludane ade mbwane jha Meditelaniya, upande ghulitipikii lyobha. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nabhabhoya palonge jhino na kwabhenge kutale, na mangota nammujhila kilambo chabhe ngita Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, chalaghila. <verse eid="JOS 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" />Yene mma nganganga na kukamuu ghoha ghighajhandikwe mu kitabo cha lilaghalikilo lya Mucha, chonde mangaghaleka jhe. <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" />Mangatangatilana jhe na bhando bheniya bhibhaighilike pakate jhino. Nkoto kuikonya ichapanga yabhe amu kulapila kwa mahina gha ichapanga yabhe, hilu kuijhinamila. <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" />Bhahe, nnombane pamonga na Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ngita chimitenda ade deleno. <verse eid="JOS 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />Nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga aibhengite palonge jhino ilambo ikolongwa ina makakala, na abhii jhe mundo jwahotwi kwanhibhilikiya mangota ade deleno. <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" />Mundo jhumo pakate jhino ndi jwahoto kwabhenga akamakoko maelufo, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ndi jwankomanila ngita chalaghila. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />Bhahe, mipalwa mma miho mu kumpala Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="JOS 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" />“Nhwalo anda munnekite Bhambo Chapanga, kulombana na ilambo henge iighalike pakate jhino, na kutolela kwabhe na bhene kutolela kwino, <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" />mmanye chakaka kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, najhendelela jhe kwabhenga bhando bhange palonge jhino, nambo nabhabha kwino ingobhahe na mitambo. Kwino naibha yato yukumbulila na mibha yukuchwapuli kumiho ade pimpa kukomelekelwa nu kubhoka mu kilambo chenje chikihalile kubhehe, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ampilingine.<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />“Ngohe kipinde chango chukujhomoka ngita chibhii kwa bhando bhange kiheghalile, nambo mangota mmanye hotuhotu kubhehe umwojho gwino na uchakaka ghoha kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino alenganikiye ghalaghila, kibhii jhe ata chimo changalenganikiya. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15" />Nambo ngita hela Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, chalenganikiya ilebhe yoha yambone yalaghila, helenaha ahoto kunnetela mabhoho ghoha ade ankomelekeye mabhoha kuhumi mu kilambo chenje chamaha champilingine. <verse eid="JOS 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16" />Anda mulitwekwii lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, lyanaghila mulikamule, kwa kuijhinamila ichapanga, bhahe, lilaka lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nalijhaka panane jhino, na mangota nankomelekelwa pulutu kajhombe, kuhumi mu kilambo chenje chikihalile champelingine.”<verse eid="JOS 23:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa alonge na bhando bhaku Chekemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />Peniya, Yoshuwa ngaghakonganicha makabila ghoha gha Akaichilahele ku Chekemo, ngabhakemita ighogholo na ilongoche na akakenga na akanahota bha ku Ichilahele, nabhene ngabhahika palonge jha Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Yoshuwa ngabhalobholila bhando bhoha, “Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwa Akaichilahele ilonge naha, makacho, akahokolo bhino bhatamita kwiye jha lukemba lwa Efulate, ngabhaijhinamila ichapanga henge. Kihoko chimo, jwakemitwa Tela, tatemundo Ulahimo na Nahole. <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />Nenga Chapanga ngannimmohita hoko gwino Ulahimo, tate gwino kuhumi kwiye jha lukemba Efulate, nganninetita pamba mu kilambo chenje cha ku Kanaane, nganimpila ibheluko twe hake. Ngannimpila Ichaka, <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" />na jwene Ichaka nganimpila Yakobu na Echau. Echau nganimpila kilambo cha itombe ya Seile kibhehe chake. Nambo Yakobu na yana mundo ngabhahelila ku Michile. <verse eid="JOS 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" />Peniya, nganatuma Mucha na Alune, nganetita mabulo mu kilambo chu ku Michile, paligha nganimmohita mangota mu kilambo chenie. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" />Nganabhohita akahoko bhino kuhumi mu kilambo chu ku Michile, na kwaleta umbwane jha Chamo. Akamichile ngabhakengimila akahoko bhino na mutuka ya ngondo jhihutwa na maponda na akakomana ngondo bhibhahobhokii falache. <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />Akaichilahele ngabhannelila ne Bhambo Chapanga, ngamekita lubhendo tyoo pakate jhabhe na Akamichile, nu kuitenda mbwane jhayekelele Akamichile. Mangota mabhene ngamalola ghinatendii Akamichile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:7">“Ngantamita ku njenga kwa yaka twe.”<verse eid="JOS 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" />Peniya, nganinongwicha ade ku kilambo cha Akaamole, bhibhatamita kwiye jha upandi ghulihumii lyobha mwa lukemba Yoludane. Ngabhakomina na mangota, nambo nenga nganintenda mahotole bheniya, ngamakomelikiya nu kutola kilambo chabhe. <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" />Balake, mwana gwa Sipole, jwakibha munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Moabo, ngaika na kwajhingilila Akaichilahele. Nganalika Baalamo, mwana jwa Beole, ahike kumpe likoto mangota. <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" />Nambo nenga nikannyokaniki jhe Balaamo, nganinkombwila mangota nu kuntenda ampe mota badala jhukumpe likoto. <verse eid="JOS 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" />Peghapetita gheniya, ngannyombwika lukemba Yoludane, ngamaika ku kilambo chuku Yeliko. Bhando bha ku Yeliko ngabhakomina na mangota. Helahela ngankomina na Akaamole na Akapeliche na Akakanaane na Akahite na Akagiligache na Akahive na Akayebuche, na mangota ngabhahotwila bheniya. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" />Punyingila mu kilambo chela nganatenda bhannyoghope kupala mabhenge akanahota akakolongwa bhabhele bha Akaamole. Makatehi jhe ghanga kwa kuyenge mapanga amu mipinde jhino. <verse eid="JOS 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" />Nganimpila mighonda mukalemite jhe, na miche mukachengite jhe, mwenio ngohe mitama na kulye michabibo na micheitune na mikongo jha micheitune jhangapanda mangota.<verse eid="JOS 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />Yoshuwa ngajhendilila kulonge, “Ngohe, munyinamii Bhambo Chapanga na kuntumikii kwa mwojho ghoha na kukuhobholeka. Mangajhinamii jhe ichapanga, ibhajhinamila akahoko bhino, kwiye jha lukemba Efulate, mu kilambo chuku Michile. Mutumikila kanjika ndo Bhambo Chapanga! <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" />Anda mpahi jhe kuntumiki Bhambo Chapanga, bhahe, deleno nhaghule ghane jhumpakutumikila. Ichapanga hela ibhajhinamila akahoko bhino, kwiye jha lukemba Efulate, amu ichapanga ya Akaamole, ngohe mitama mu kilambo chabhe. Nambo nenga na nyumba jhango, natunyinamila Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Bhando bheniya ngabhajhangwila, “Tuhoto ng'o kunneka Bhambo Chapanga na kuijhinamii ichapanga henge! <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" />Nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito, ndi jwatubhoita twenga pamonga na akahoko bhito, mu kilambo cha ku Michile kutukibha akabhanda, ngatulola kwa miho ghito tabhete mahengo gha kukangacha ghateila. Ngatulondita umwanja gwito na pakate jha bhando bheniya ngatupeta pakate jhabhe. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" />Bhambo Chapanga ngabhabhohita bhando bhoha Akaamole bhutamita mu kilambo chene. Yene twenga natunyinamila Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo ndi Chapanga gwito.”<verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />Nambo Yoshuwa ngabhalobhalila, “Mangota mihoto jhe kunnyinamii Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo jwene ndi Chapanga jwa nyahinyahi na jhuna wiho, jwene ihoto jhe kunekekeya changantembekeya. <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" />Anda munnekite Bhambo Chapanga na kuijhinmii ichapanga jha kighene, nanchwapula na kukomelekeya njwe, pamo nu kuntende ghambone ghoha ghano pala pututumbwila.”<verse eid="JOS 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Nambo bhando ngabhannobholila Yoshuwa, “Naha jhe! Twenga natunnyinamila Bhambo Chapanga tugha.”<verse eid="JOS 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Yoshuwa ngabhalobhalila, “Mangota mabhene ndi machahide bha miojho jhino kubhehe nhagwii kunyinamila Bhambo Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:22">Na bhene ngabhanyangwila, “Ena, twe ndi akachaide.” <verse eid="JOS 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" />Jwene ngabhalobholila, “Bhahe, mmohengane ichapanga jha kighene jhiminako, mukankengima Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwa Akaichilahele, kwa mwojho gwino gwoha.”<verse eid="JOS 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Bhando bheniya ngabhannyangwila Yoshuwa, “Natunyinamila na kunnyokanikiya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito.”<verse eid="JOS 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" />Yene, Yoshuwa ngabhekita lilaghano na bhando bheniya, kwenio ku Chekemo, ngabhapila nhwilo na malaghalikilo ghukukamula. <verse eid="JOS 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />Yoshuwa ngajhandika ghanga ghoha mu kitabo cha lilaghalikilo lya Chapanga, peniya, ngatola lighanga likolongwa na kujhemeka pahe jha mwalone, pahina na palihema lya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" />Peniya, ngabhalobhalila bhando bhoha, “Lighanga lende nalibhaha uchaide gwito, nhwalo lijhohine malobhe ghoha ghatulobholila Bhambo Chapanga. Nalibhaha uchaide kwino anda namuneka Chapanga gwino.” <verse eid="JOS 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Bhahe, Yoshuwa ngabhalekikiya bhando bhajhende, na bhene ngabhabhujhita kila mundo kajhake.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa na Eleazale bhiwegha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />Pughapetita gheniya ghoha, Yoshuwa, mwana gwa Nune na ntumiche gwa Bhambo Chapanga, ngajhomwika kongo akibha na yaka miya jhimo na kome. <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" />Bheniya ngabhanchika mu chehemo pibhamaghulila kubhehe pabhe, kwenio ku Timunate sela, mu itombe ya Efulaimo, upandi gwa kachikachine mu itombe ya ku Gaashe.<verse eid="JOS 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" />Akaichilahele ngabhantumikila Bhambo Chapanga, kipinde choha cha ughome gwa Yoshuwa, na kipinde choha chibhatamita ighogholo na bhene bhakalolite kwa miho ghabhe kila kilebhe Bhambo Chapanga chabhatendila Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JOS 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />Ihupa ya Uchupo yenie Akaichilahele ngabhailetita kuhumi ku Michile, ngabhaichikita, kwenio ku Chekemo chehemo jhakahemi Yakobu, kwa yana ya Amole, tate mundo Chekemo, kwa ipande miya jhimo ya madine gha feza. Undope gwenio ngaubhila gwabhe ibheluko ya Uchupo.<verse eid="JOS 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" />Eleazale mwana gwa Alune, hele ngajhomwika na kuchikwa ku Gibeya, muche gwenio ngapilwa Finehasi, mwana mundo, mu ilambo ya itombe ya ku Efulaimo.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>